1
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:19,240
<font color="#ffffff">THEME PLAYS</font>

2
00:00:41,200 --> 00:00:44,320
<font color="#ffffff">WHIMSICAL MUSIC</font>
<font color="#ffffff">TARDIS BEEPS</font>

3
00:00:45,720 --> 00:00:47,760
<font color="#ffffff">SIZZLING</font>

4
00:00:52,360 --> 00:00:54,520
<font color="#ffffff">SHE GASPS</font>

5
00:00:54,520 --> 00:00:55,960
<font color="#ffff00">Oh!</font>

6
00:00:57,800 --> 00:00:59,280
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor!</font>

7
00:01:00,680 --> 00:01:03,080
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor, where are you?</font>

8
00:01:03,080 --> 00:01:04,560
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor?!</font>

9
00:01:08,400 --> 00:01:10,040
<font color="#ffffff">BOTH GASP</font>

10
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:13,920
<font color="#ffff00">Steven.</font>

11
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:17,320
<font color="#00ffff">Vicki, is that you?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Steven!</font>

12
00:01:17,320 --> 00:01:21,480
<font color="#00ffff">Oh!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Oh, Steven!</font>

13
00:01:22,800 --> 00:01:27,040
<font color="#00ffff">God, am I dreaming?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">If you are, then I must be too.</font>

14
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:32,080
<font color="#ffff00">Look at you, you look so regal.</font>

15
00:01:32,080 --> 00:01:36,320
<font color="#00ffff">When I left the Doctor,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I did become a king, you know.</font>

16
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:38,920
<font color="#ffffff">SHE LAUGHS</font>

17
00:01:36,320 --> 00:01:38,920
<font color="#ffff00">A king?!</font>

18
00:01:38,920 --> 00:01:40,320
<font color="#ffffff">SHE SIGHS</font>

19
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:43,000
<font color="#ffff00">Troilus and I gave it all up</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to grow olives in the hills.</font>

20
00:01:43,000 --> 00:01:44,320
<font color="#ffff00">I'm a farmer now.</font>

21
00:01:44,320 --> 00:01:46,560
<font color="#00ffff">You look great.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Rubbish.</font>

22
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,480
<font color="#00ffff">No, you do, Vicki.</font>

23
00:01:48,480 --> 00:01:50,320
<font color="#00ffff">The years have been good to us.</font>

24
00:01:50,320 --> 00:01:52,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I've had</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the most marvellous life.</font>

25
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:56,320
<font color="#ffff00">Children. Grandchildren!</font>

26
00:01:56,320 --> 00:01:57,800
<font color="#00ffff">Me too.</font>

27
00:01:57,800 --> 00:02:02,200
<font color="#00ffff">And now look -</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I've got my little sister back!</font>

28
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:05,720
<font color="#ffffff">SHE LAUGHS</font>

29
00:02:02,200 --> 00:02:05,720
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, Steven!</font>

30
00:02:09,320 --> 00:02:11,040
<font color="#00ffff">Will you look at this place?</font>

31
00:02:11,040 --> 00:02:15,120
<font color="#00ffff">I can't believe</font>
<font color="#00ffff">we're back in the TARDIS.</font>

32
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:18,000
<font color="#ffff00">Yeah, but where's the Doctor?</font>

33
00:02:19,160 --> 00:02:21,560
<font color="#ffff00">I've got so much to tell him.</font>

34
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:24,760
<font color="#ffff00">Troilus, my children...</font>

35
00:02:24,760 --> 00:02:28,440
<font color="#ffff00">All the things I never thought</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to have are down to him.</font>

36
00:02:28,440 --> 00:02:29,920
<font color="#ffff00">I need to...</font>

37
00:02:29,920 --> 00:02:32,040
<font color="#ffff00">I need to say thank you.</font>

38
00:02:32,040 --> 00:02:35,800
<font color="#00ffff">Vicki, this might not be his TARDIS.</font>

39
00:02:35,800 --> 00:02:40,120
<font color="#00ffff">I mean, can you imagine the Doctor</font>
<font color="#00ffff">wearing something like this?</font>

40
00:02:41,160 --> 00:02:43,920
<font color="#ffff00">Of course it's his TARDIS.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I found his pocket watch.</font>

41
00:02:47,080 --> 00:02:48,880
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, Doctor...</font>

42
00:02:48,880 --> 00:02:50,160
<font color="#ffff00">Where are you?</font>

43
00:02:52,200 --> 00:02:55,920
<font color="#00ffff">Be careful, Vicki. We not used</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to this sort of thing now.</font>

44
00:02:55,920 --> 00:02:59,760
<font color="#00ffff">It might be some kind of trap.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Don't be such a spoilsport.</font>

45
00:02:59,760 --> 00:03:04,680
<font color="#00ffff">I'm just be a little more cautious</font>
<font color="#00ffff">these days. Older and wiser.</font>

46
00:03:04,680 --> 00:03:06,440
<font color="#ffff00">Look!</font>

47
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:09,600
<font color="#ffff00">We found this on the beach that day.</font>

48
00:03:09,600 --> 00:03:11,440
<font color="#ffff00">Don't you remember?</font>

49
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:13,920
<font color="#ffff00">I wonder how it got here.</font>

50
00:03:13,920 --> 00:03:16,160
<font color="#ffffff">WHOOSHING</font>

51
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:27,560
<font color="#00ffff">The same way these got here.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Oh!</font>

52
00:03:34,720 --> 00:03:37,080
<font color="#00ffff">But, yes, I do remember that helmet.</font>

53
00:03:37,080 --> 00:03:40,960
<font color="#00ffff">And I remember how hard you kept</font>
<font color="#00ffff">on trying to prove to me</font>

54
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:43,480
<font color="#00ffff">that the TARDIS was a time machine.</font>

55
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:47,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, yes, and there we were,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in Northumberland, in 1066,</font>

56
00:03:47,600 --> 00:03:49,800
<font color="#ffff00">and you still refused to believe it.</font>

57
00:03:49,800 --> 00:03:52,440
<font color="#00ffff">Well, it had been a busy week.</font>

58
00:03:52,440 --> 00:03:58,040
<font color="#00ffff">I mean, what with Mechanoids</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and Daleks... You know.</font>

59
00:03:58,040 --> 00:04:01,880
<font color="#ffff00">And then there were Vikings</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and Saxons,</font>

60
00:04:01,880 --> 00:04:04,240
<font color="#ffff00">a time-meddling monk...</font>

61
00:04:04,240 --> 00:04:07,320
<font color="#00ffff">A typical day in the TARDIS.</font>

62
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:10,600
<font color="#ffffff">BOTH CHUCKLE, SHE SIGHS</font>

63
00:04:07,320 --> 00:04:10,600
<font color="#ffff00">Such a long time ago.</font>

64
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:16,240
<font color="#ffff00">But now it just seems</font>
<font color="#ffff00">like yesterday.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes.</font>

65
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:20,040
<font color="#ffff00">We'd been on Mechanus, remember?</font>

66
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:24,120
<font color="#ffff00">And then the Doctor and I thought</font>
<font color="#ffff00">we were all alone...</font>

67
00:04:25,320 --> 00:04:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">CLOCK TICKS</font>

68
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:41,440
<font color="#ffffff">I shall miss them, Doctor.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Who?</font>

69
00:04:41,440 --> 00:04:43,240
<font color="#ffffff">Ian and Barbara.</font>

70
00:04:47,600 --> 00:04:51,160
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, I shall miss them, too.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">First Susan and now them.</font>

71
00:04:53,960 --> 00:04:55,800
<font color="#ffff00">Come over here, my dear,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'd like to talk to you.</font>

72
00:04:55,800 --> 00:04:57,080
<font color="#ffffff">What about the control panel?</font>

73
00:04:57,080 --> 00:05:00,000
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, that's all right, my dear.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It's already set.</font>

74
00:05:05,720 --> 00:05:10,280
<font color="#ffff00">Their decision certainly surprised</font>
<font color="#ffff00">me, although it shouldn't, I know.</font>

75
00:05:10,280 --> 00:05:12,160
<font color="#ffff00">But it was quite obvious</font>
<font color="#ffff00">they intended</font>

76
00:05:12,160 --> 00:05:15,080
<font color="#ffff00">to take the first opportunity</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of going back home.</font>

77
00:05:15,080 --> 00:05:17,520
<font color="#ffffff">Well, they weren't getting</font>
<font color="#ffffff">any younger, were they?</font>

78
00:05:17,520 --> 00:05:20,440
<font color="#ffff00">It's lucky for you, child, they're</font>
<font color="#ffff00">not here to hear you say that!</font>

79
00:05:20,440 --> 00:05:23,720
<font color="#ffff00">Gracious me! You think they're old?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What do you think of me?</font>

80
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:26,160
<font color="#ffffff">You're different, Doctor.</font>

81
00:05:26,160 --> 00:05:28,640
<font color="#ffffff">Anyway, we may land in their time</font>
<font color="#ffffff">one day</font>

82
00:05:28,640 --> 00:05:30,760
<font color="#ffffff">and be able to talk over old times.</font>

83
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:33,520
<font color="#ffff00">Well, perhaps, Vicki. Perhaps.</font>

84
00:05:34,440 --> 00:05:38,640
<font color="#ffffff">Anyway, it's done now.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Mm.</font>

85
00:05:40,880 --> 00:05:43,080
<font color="#ffffff">I wonder where the TARDIS</font>
<font color="#ffffff">will take us next.</font>

86
00:05:43,080 --> 00:05:47,240
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, it's done now, although I must</font>
<font color="#ffff00">admit, I'm left with a small worry.</font>

87
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:49,080
<font color="#ffffff">You know, I wouldn't mind New York.</font>

88
00:05:49,080 --> 00:05:52,160
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't get to see a lot of it,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">what with the Daleks and everything.</font>

89
00:05:52,160 --> 00:05:54,320
<font color="#ffffff">But what I saw from the top</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of the Empire State Building,</font>

90
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,640
<font color="#ffffff">I wouldn't mind</font>
<font color="#ffffff">going back there.</font>

91
00:05:55,640 --> 00:05:57,760
<font color="#ffff00">My dear Vicki,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'm trying to talk to you.</font>

92
00:05:57,760 --> 00:06:00,120
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, sorry.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I just wanted to ask you,</font>

93
00:06:00,120 --> 00:06:02,520
<font color="#ffff00">are you sure you didn't</font>
<font color="#ffff00">want to go home too, hmm?</font>

94
00:06:02,520 --> 00:06:05,840
<font color="#ffff00">I didn't give you very much time</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to consider, now, did I?</font>

95
00:06:05,840 --> 00:06:08,080
<font color="#ffff00">I should hate to think</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that you're just staying</font>

96
00:06:08,080 --> 00:06:09,320
<font color="#ffff00">for the sake of an old man.</font>

97
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:14,920
<font color="#ffffff">Doctor! I made my decision,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I wanted to stay.</font>

98
00:06:14,920 --> 00:06:18,600
<font color="#ffffff">Anyway, I wouldn't have anything</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to go back to.</font>

99
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,920
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, your father...</font>

100
00:06:19,920 --> 00:06:23,200
<font color="#ffffff">RATTLING</font>

101
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:26,600
<font color="#ffffff">Did you hear that?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yes, perhaps</font>
<font color="#ffff00">it's something fallen down</font>

102
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:29,440
<font color="#ffff00">or maybe we've changed course. Hmm?</font>

103
00:06:29,440 --> 00:06:31,960
<font color="#ffffff">THUD</font>

104
00:06:31,960 --> 00:06:35,400
<font color="#ffffff">WHISPERING: There's someone</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in the living quarters.</font>

105
00:06:45,920 --> 00:06:48,880
<font color="#ffffff">Doctor, be careful.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It's obviously a Dalek!</font>

106
00:06:59,520 --> 00:07:00,920
<font color="#ffffff">GASPING</font>

107
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:17,040
<font color="#ffffff">Steven!</font>

108
00:07:21,560 --> 00:07:23,600
<font color="#ffffff">METALLIC THRUMMING</font>

109
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:45,640
<font color="#ffffff">I wonder. Oh, I wonder.</font>

110
00:07:54,160 --> 00:07:57,560
<font color="#00ffff">Thanks. Sorry about that, Doc.</font>

111
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:03,200
<font color="#ffffff">We thought you were dead.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I nearly was.</font>

112
00:08:03,200 --> 00:08:06,080
<font color="#00ffff">I just managed to climb down</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that cable before it burned out.</font>

113
00:08:06,080 --> 00:08:08,440
<font color="#00ffff">Then I came after you.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You should have shouted.</font>

114
00:08:08,440 --> 00:08:10,720
<font color="#00ffff">Should have? I never stopped!</font>

115
00:08:12,240 --> 00:08:16,560
<font color="#00ffff">Say, this is quite a ship</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you've got here, Doc.</font>

116
00:08:16,560 --> 00:08:20,880
<font color="#00ffff">Never seen anything like it.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Now</font>
<font color="#ffff00">listen to me, young man. Sit down.</font>

117
00:08:23,160 --> 00:08:27,200
<font color="#ffff00">Now, there are two things</font>
<font color="#ffff00">you can do.</font>

118
00:08:27,200 --> 00:08:29,560
<font color="#ffff00">One, sit there until you get</font>
<font color="#ffff00">your breath back</font>

119
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:33,360
<font color="#ffff00">and, two, don't call me "Doc".</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Now, do I make myself clear?</font>

120
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:36,560
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, yes,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">whatever you say, Doc...tor.</font>

121
00:08:36,560 --> 00:08:39,200
<font color="#ffff00">Apart from that, young man,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'm quite willing to accept you</font>

122
00:08:39,200 --> 00:08:41,200
<font color="#ffff00">at your face value.</font>

123
00:08:45,880 --> 00:08:49,480
<font color="#ffffff">You were lucky to find the TARDIS</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in all that jungle.</font>

124
00:08:51,800 --> 00:08:55,200
<font color="#00ffff">Yeah, we were lucky.</font>

125
00:08:55,200 --> 00:08:59,000
<font color="#00ffff">You know, I don't seem to remember</font>
<font color="#00ffff">much about it. There was a door.</font>

126
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:00,880
<font color="#00ffff">When I went through it,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I must have flaked out.</font>

127
00:09:00,880 --> 00:09:04,160
<font color="#00ffff">I remember registering that, well,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">it didn't look like a ship</font>

128
00:09:04,160 --> 00:09:07,520
<font color="#00ffff">and it was very small.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I must have been delirious.</font>

129
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:10,000
<font color="#ffffff">I don't suppose you were.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It is very small outside.</font>

130
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:12,720
<font color="#ffffff">It's just in here it's big.</font>

131
00:09:12,720 --> 00:09:14,520
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, come off it!</font>

132
00:09:15,920 --> 00:09:17,520
<font color="#ffffff">You don't believe me, do you?</font>

133
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:19,760
<font color="#00ffff">Of course I do, Vicki!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Every word!</font>

134
00:09:19,760 --> 00:09:23,480
<font color="#ffffff">This isn't an ordinary ship,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you know. This is a time machine.</font>

135
00:09:23,480 --> 00:09:27,160
<font color="#00ffff">Time machine? Look, this ship</font>
<font color="#00ffff">may have a way-out design,</font>

136
00:09:27,160 --> 00:09:28,480
<font color="#00ffff">but time machines?</font>

137
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,520
<font color="#00ffff">That's ridiculous.</font>

138
00:09:30,520 --> 00:09:31,840
<font color="#ffffff">Doctor?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Mm?</font>

139
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,760
<font color="#ffffff">He says the TARDIS</font>
<font color="#ffffff">isn't a time machine.</font>

140
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:35,880
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, does he now?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Tell him.</font>

141
00:09:35,880 --> 00:09:39,000
<font color="#ffff00">I don't see why I should, my child.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">He'll learn soon enough.</font>

142
00:09:39,000 --> 00:09:41,240
<font color="#00ffff">Look, Doctor, I've seen some</font>
<font color="#00ffff">spaceships in my time,</font>

143
00:09:41,240 --> 00:09:44,400
<font color="#00ffff">admittedly nothing like this, but...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Well, what does this do?</font>

144
00:09:44,400 --> 00:09:49,040
<font color="#ffff00">That is the dematerialising control,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and that over yonder</font>

145
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:52,080
<font color="#ffff00">is the horizontal hold.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Up there is the scanner,</font>

146
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:55,120
<font color="#ffff00">those are the doors, that is a chair</font>
<font color="#ffff00">with a panda on it...</font>

147
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:59,480
<font color="#ffff00">Sheer poetry, dear boy! Now, please,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">stop bothering me!</font>

148
00:09:59,480 --> 00:10:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">VICKI GIGGLING</font>

149
00:10:01,080 --> 00:10:04,440
<font color="#00ffff">Look, you gave this ship a name</font>
<font color="#00ffff">just now, what was it?</font>

150
00:10:04,440 --> 00:10:07,760
<font color="#ffffff">TARDIS. T-A-R-D-I-S.</font>

151
00:10:07,760 --> 00:10:13,280
<font color="#ffffff">It stands for Time and Relative</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Dimensions In Space.</font>

152
00:10:15,800 --> 00:10:18,800
<font color="#00ffff">IDBI.</font><font color="#ffffff"> What? IDBI?</font>

153
00:10:18,800 --> 00:10:21,760
<font color="#00ffff">Mm. I-D-B-I.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yeah?</font>

154
00:10:21,760 --> 00:10:24,360
<font color="#00ffff">It means "I Don't Believe It".</font>

155
00:10:24,360 --> 00:10:26,600
<font color="#ffffff">You'll see, you'll see.</font>

156
00:10:30,080 --> 00:10:31,840
<font color="#ffff00">Vicki?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes?</font>

157
00:10:31,840 --> 00:10:33,520
<font color="#ffff00">I've checked up on all the readings.</font>

158
00:10:33,520 --> 00:10:37,120
<font color="#ffff00">Now, I think our guest will need</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a wash and brush up.</font>

159
00:10:37,120 --> 00:10:39,400
<font color="#ffff00">So I think the best thing</font>
<font color="#ffff00">for you to do is</font>

160
00:10:39,400 --> 00:10:43,320
<font color="#ffff00">to go and find him some clothes and</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a cloak. Bring mine as well.</font>

161
00:10:43,320 --> 00:10:46,320
<font color="#ffff00">We'll show him whether this is</font>
<font color="#ffff00">a time machine or not, hmm?</font>

162
00:10:46,320 --> 00:10:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">Where are we?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Judging</font>
<font color="#ffff00">by the readings, my child,</font>

163
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,880
<font color="#ffff00">I think we've landed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">on the planet Earth.</font>

164
00:11:18,440 --> 00:11:20,640
<font color="#ffffff">Wulnoth with you?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Inside.</font>

165
00:11:24,680 --> 00:11:26,920
<font color="#ffffff">Something's landed on the beach.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I saw it from the cliff.</font>

166
00:11:26,920 --> 00:11:30,200
<font color="#00ffff">What is it?</font><font color="#ffffff"> A large box</font>
<font color="#ffffff">washed ashore by the tide,</font>

167
00:11:30,200 --> 00:11:33,240
<font color="#ffffff">probably from a ship.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I didn't go down, I came for you.</font>

168
00:11:33,240 --> 00:11:37,200
<font color="#00ffff">What sort of box?</font><font color="#ffffff"> I don't know.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It's just very big.</font>

169
00:11:37,200 --> 00:11:40,040
<font color="#ffffff">I've never seen</font>
<font color="#ffffff">anything like it before.</font>

170
00:11:41,680 --> 00:11:44,720
<font color="#00ffff">The tide will be turning.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">We must hurry.</font>

171
00:11:46,160 --> 00:11:47,920
<font color="#00ffff">You lead the way.</font>

172
