<font color="#ffff00">I'm sorry, but I must take your...</font>
<font color="#ffff00">My leave of you.</font>

328
00:23:09,000 --> 00:23:13,440
<font color="#ffffff">Are you going to the monastery?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I most certainly am.</font>

329
00:23:13,440 --> 00:23:15,040
<font color="#ffffff">HE CHUCKLES</font>

330
00:23:32,320 --> 00:23:35,560
<font color="#00ffff">Look, are you coming?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Can't we rest a minute?</font>

331
00:23:35,560 --> 00:23:39,840
<font color="#00ffff">We just did!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh! Well, I'm tired.</font>

332
00:23:39,840 --> 00:23:41,440
<font color="#ffffff">VICKI SIGHS</font>

333
00:23:42,880 --> 00:23:45,760
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, we'll...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">We'll wait a little while.</font>

334
00:23:45,760 --> 00:23:47,800
<font color="#00ffff">But we're lost.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">We can't stay here all night.</font>

335
00:23:47,800 --> 00:23:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">TWIG SNAPPING</font>

336
00:23:49,000 --> 00:23:51,040
<font color="#ffffff">Shh!</font><font color="#00ffff"> What's the matter?</font>

337
00:23:51,040 --> 00:23:54,640
<font color="#ffffff">WHISPERING: I think</font>
<font color="#ffffff">somebody's coming.</font>

338
00:23:54,640 --> 00:23:56,560
<font color="#00ffff">Why are we hiding?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">We can ask him the way.</font>

339
00:23:56,560 --> 00:23:58,720
<font color="#ffffff">No! Because I think</font>
<font color="#ffffff">we should follow him</font>

340
00:23:58,720 --> 00:24:01,160
<font color="#ffffff">until we find out whether</font>
<font color="#ffffff">it's safe or not.</font>

341
00:24:01,160 --> 00:24:02,760
<font color="#00ffff">Oh.</font>

342
00:24:02,760 --> 00:24:05,840
<font color="#ffffff">Supposing you do</font>
<font color="#ffffff">what I say for once!</font>

343
00:24:24,960 --> 00:24:27,760
<font color="#ffffff">He's found something.</font><font color="#00ffff"> What is it?</font>

344
00:24:27,760 --> 00:24:31,120
<font color="#ffffff">I can't see.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Did you drop something?</font>

345
00:24:33,120 --> 00:24:34,880
<font color="#00ffff">Hey! You!</font>

346
00:24:35,800 --> 00:24:38,400
<font color="#00ffff">Hey! Come back!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Steven!</font>

347
00:24:41,040 --> 00:24:42,520
<font color="#ffffff">Steven, I...</font>

348
00:24:42,520 --> 00:24:46,760
<font color="#ffffff">Leave him alone!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Stop it! Stop it! Steven!</font>

349
00:25:02,240 --> 00:25:05,240
<font color="#ffffff">You all right? Hmm?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, I think so.</font>

350
00:25:06,240 --> 00:25:08,440
<font color="#00ffff">I got it.</font><font color="#ffffff"> What was it?</font>

351
00:25:12,440 --> 00:25:15,480
<font color="#00ffff">You still say</font>
<font color="#00ffff">this is 10th century England?</font>

352
00:25:19,160 --> 00:25:21,120
<font color="#ffffff">MONKS SINGING</font>

353
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:03,200
<font color="#ffffff">SINGING STOPS</font>

354
00:27:03,200 --> 00:27:05,280
<font color="#ffffff">LAUGHING</font>

355
00:27:13,120 --> 00:27:14,680
<font color="#ffffff">LAUGHING</font>

356
00:27:21,160 --> 00:27:23,200
<font color="#00ffff">Oh! Ah!</font>

357
00:28:59,520 --> 00:29:02,760
<font color="#00ffff">Breakfast! Breakfast!</font>

358
00:29:02,760 --> 00:29:05,880
<font color="#00ffff">Come along.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Early to bed, early to rise!</font>

359
00:29:07,520 --> 00:29:09,760
<font color="#00ffff">Come on, do you want the eggs</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to get cold?</font>

360
00:29:09,760 --> 00:29:12,480
<font color="#ffffff">Go away!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I'll come out when I'm ready.</font>

361
00:29:13,760 --> 00:29:15,680
<font color="#ffffff">HE GROANS</font>

362
00:29:48,800 --> 00:29:50,640
<font color="#ffff00">Steven?</font>

363
00:29:52,080 --> 00:29:53,160
<font color="#ffff00">Steven?</font>

364
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:54,440
<font color="#ffffff">TWIG SNAPS</font>

365
00:30:00,120 --> 00:30:03,680
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, Steven!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Morning! What are you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">looking so jittery about?</font>

366
00:30:03,680 --> 00:30:06,200
<font color="#ffff00">I thought I heard somebody</font>
<font color="#ffff00">moving about in the bushes.</font>

367
00:30:06,200 --> 00:30:08,400
<font color="#00ffff">That was me,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I was looking for some food.</font>

368
00:30:08,400 --> 00:30:10,480
<font color="#ffff00">Did you find anything?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">That's a matter of opinion.</font>

369
00:30:10,480 --> 00:30:12,600
<font color="#00ffff">Want some breakfast?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, yes, please.</font>

370
00:30:12,600 --> 00:30:15,880
<font color="#00ffff">Well, you can either have</font>
<font color="#00ffff">some blackberries or...</font>

371
00:30:15,880 --> 00:30:17,520
<font color="#00ffff">..or some blackberries.</font>

372
00:30:17,520 --> 00:30:20,120
<font color="#ffff00">I don't think it matters, thanks.</font>

373
00:30:20,120 --> 00:30:23,760
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I'm freezing.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Mm. We'd better get moving, then.</font>

374
00:30:23,760 --> 00:30:26,320
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, what, back to the TARDIS?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes.</font>

375
00:30:26,320 --> 00:30:29,120
<font color="#00ffff">If the Doctor's not there,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">we'll have to think again.</font>

376
00:30:30,320 --> 00:30:32,360
<font color="#ffff00">I wonder what time it is.</font>

377
00:30:34,840 --> 00:30:36,760
<font color="#00ffff">20 past five.</font>

378
00:30:37,880 --> 00:30:39,880
<font color="#ffff00">I wonder if the Doctor</font>
<font color="#ffff00">did drop that...</font>

379
00:30:39,880 --> 00:30:42,480
<font color="#00ffff">You said he didn't have a watch.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I said I didn't think he had.</font>

380
00:30:42,480 --> 00:30:45,320
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, why don't you admit all</font>
<font color="#00ffff">this tenth century stuff's just...?</font>

381
00:30:45,320 --> 00:30:46,920
<font color="#ffffff">TWIG SNAPS</font>

382
00:30:55,600 --> 00:30:57,120
<font color="#ffff00">There's somebody there!</font>

383
00:30:59,720 --> 00:31:02,720
<font color="#ffff00">Steven! Steven!</font>

384
00:31:04,440 --> 00:31:06,160
<font color="#ffff00">Ah!</font>

385
00:31:11,720 --> 00:31:13,400
<font color="#00ff00">What shall we do with them?</font>

386
00:31:15,120 --> 00:31:16,600
<font color="#ffffff">Take them to the village.</font>

387
00:31:49,280 --> 00:31:50,840
<font color="#ffffff">Good morning, Father.</font>

388
00:31:50,840 --> 00:31:55,920
<font color="#00ffff">Ah... Ah, good morning, my children,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">good morning.</font>

389
00:31:55,920 --> 00:32:00,000
<font color="#00ffff">Oh! So deep was I in my meditations,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I failed to see you arrive.</font>

390
00:32:00,000 --> 00:32:01,600
<font color="#00ffff">You must forgive me.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh, no.</font>

391
00:32:01,600 --> 00:32:04,680
<font color="#ffffff">It is we who should ask forgiveness</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of you, disturbing you like this.</font>

392
00:32:04,680 --> 00:32:07,680
<font color="#00ffff">No, please, please.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">You're always welcome here.</font>

393
00:32:07,680 --> 00:32:11,480
<font color="#ffffff">We, erm...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We thought you might need some food.</font>

394
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:13,800
<font color="#00ffff">Ah, how very charitable of you,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">my dear.</font>

395
00:32:13,800 --> 00:32:16,920
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I'm sorry, Father.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">It's poor fare for the likes of you.</font>

396
00:32:16,920 --> 00:32:19,320
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, but don't distress yourself,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">my child.</font>

397
00:32:19,320 --> 00:32:23,000
<font color="#00ffff">We must all be prepared to make</font>
<font color="#00ffff">sacrifices when they're asked of us.</font>

398
00:32:24,320 --> 00:32:30,080
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I would like to stop and talk</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and pass the time of day with you,</font>

399
00:32:30,080 --> 00:32:33,720
<font color="#00ffff">but this morning, solitude and study</font>
<font color="#00ffff">are uppermost in my mind.</font>

400
00:32:33,720 --> 00:32:35,960
<font color="#ffffff">We understand, Father.</font>

401
00:32:35,960 --> 00:32:39,320
<font color="#00ffff">Thank you again, my child.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Good morning.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Morning, Father.</font>

402
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:07,240
<font color="#ffffff">Open this door!</font>

403
00:33:05,160 --> 00:33:07,240
<font color="#ffffff">BANGING</font>

404
00:33:07,240 --> 00:33:09,880
<font color="#ffffff">Open this door, will you?! Open it!</font>

405
00:34:48,040 --> 00:34:50,400
<font color="#00ffff">At last! At last!</font>

406
00:35:10,480 --> 00:35:12,240
<font color="#ffff00">You all right?</font>

407
00:35:12,240 --> 00:35:15,200
<font color="#00ffff">I've felt better.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I dare say I'll get over it.</font>

408
00:35:17,040 --> 00:35:19,440
<font color="#00ffff">It's pretty authentic Saxon,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">isn't it?</font>

409
00:35:19,440 --> 00:35:21,680
<font color="#ffff00">Don't tell me you've actually</font>
<font color="#ffff00">started to believe us?</font>

410
00:35:21,680 --> 00:35:25,320
<font color="#00ffff">They'd hardly go to all this trouble</font>
<font color="#00ffff">for a fancy dress ball, would they?</font>

411
00:35:26,520 --> 00:35:28,400
<font color="#00ffff">We've got to get out of here.</font>

412
00:35:35,080 --> 00:35:37,200
<font color="#ffff00">It looks as though</font>
<font color="#ffff00">they want us to stay.</font>

413
00:35:37,200 --> 00:35:39,840
<font color="#00ffff">Yes. We must be more popular</font>
<font color="#00ffff">than we thought.</font>

414
00:35:39,840 --> 00:35:43,400
<font color="#00ff00">Wulnoth, we can't just let them go!</font>

415
00:35:43,400 --> 00:35:46,360
<font color="#ffffff">Their clothes are strange.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">If they're travellers...</font>

416
00:35:46,360 --> 00:35:49,000
<font color="#00ff00">Travellers?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">With no provisions or belongings?!</font>

417
00:35:49,000 --> 00:35:50,760
<font color="#00ff00">And travelled from where?</font>

418
00:35:50,760 --> 00:35:53,200
<font color="#ffff00">Well, we can ask them.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Why listen to their lies?!</font>

419
00:35:53,200 --> 00:35:55,720
<font color="#00ff00">They've been put ashore on the coast</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to spy for the Vikings.</font>

420
00:35:55,720 --> 00:35:58,400
<font color="#ffff00">You've got no proof of that!</font><font color="#00ff00"> Nor do</font>
<font color="#00ff00">we have proof of what you say!</font>

421
00:35:58,400 --> 00:36:00,600
<font color="#ffff00">Maybe not, but I'm the headman!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">You may be headman now,</font>

422
00:36:00,600 --> 00:36:03,000
<font color="#00ff00">but when the people hear</font>
<font color="#00ff00">how you treated their enemies...</font>

423
00:36:03,000 --> 00:36:05,800
<font color="#00ff00">..those two will be killed!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Eldred!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Eldred!</font>

424
00:36:12,240 --> 00:36:15,080
<font color="#ffffff">Are you looking for an old man</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with long white hair?</font>

425
00:36:16,280 --> 00:36:18,400
<font color="#00ffff">You've seen him?</font><font color="#ffff00"> Of which old man</font>
<font color="#ffff00">do you speak, woman?</font>

426
00:36:18,400 --> 00:36:20,680
<font color="#ffffff">He came here last night,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">wore clothes like these people.</font>

427
00:36:20,680 --> 00:36:23,120
<font color="#00ffff">Do you know where he is now?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Did you question him?</font><font color="#ffffff"> A little.</font>

428
00:36:23,120 --> 00:36:25,800
<font color="#ffffff">He said he was a traveller.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Then he</font>
<font color="#00ff00">lied.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Oh, for goodness' sake!</font>

429
00:36:25,800 --> 00:36:29,640
<font color="#00ff00">Wulnoth, I do not trust them!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Well, I'm not mad about you either.</font>

430
00:36:29,640 --> 00:36:32,480
<font color="#ffff00">I think these people are what they</font>
<font color="#ffff00">say they are, innocent travellers.</font>

431
00:36:32,480 --> 00:36:33,680
<font color="#00ff00">I do not trust them.</font>

432
00:36:33,680 --> 00:36:36,360
<font color="#00ff00">Sooner or later, you will regret</font>
<font color="#00ff00">that you didn't listen to me.</font>

433
00:36:36,360 --> 00:36:38,720
<font color="#ffffff">Are you going to stand here</font>
<font color="#ffffff">arguing all day?</font>

434
00:36:38,720 --> 00:36:41,480
<font color="#ffffff">Either let us go or...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">do whatever you're going to do,</font>

435
00:36:41,480 --> 00:36:43,360
<font color="#ffffff">but make up your minds.</font>

436
00:36:47,240 --> 00:36:48,920
<font color="#ffff00">You can go.</font>

437
00:36:48,920 --> 00:36:51,760
<font color="#ffff00">Edith, take the girl inside</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and get some food for their journey.</font>

438
00:37:06,320 --> 00:37:09,520
<font color="#ffffff">And the Doctor, the old man,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">what happened to him?</font>

439
00:37:09,520 --> 00:37:10,960
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, he was going to stay,</font>

440
00:37:10,960 --> 00:37:13,200
<font color="#ffff00">and then he suddenly decided</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to visit the monastery.</font>

441
00:37:13,200 --> 00:37:15,800
<font color="#ffffff">That's quite near here, isn't it?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I heard the singing.</font>

442
00:37:15,800 --> 00:37:19,160
<font color="#ffff00">It's not far. It's just at the top</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of the hill behind the forest.</font>

443
00:37:19,160 --> 00:37:20,320
<font color="#ffff00">I can take you.</font>

444
00:37:20,320 --> 00:37:22,640
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, um, well...</font>

445
00:37:22,640 --> 00:37:24,520
<font color="#ffffff">..it's all right, thanks.</font>

446
00:37:24,520 --> 00:37:26,200
<font color="#ffff00">Oh. Here.</font>

447
00:37:29,800 --> 00:37:31,360
<font color="#ffffff">Steven?</font>

448
00:37:38,600 --> 00:37:39,840
<font color="#00ffff">Thanks.</font>

449
00:37:43,000 --> 00:37:45,640
<font color="#00ffff">Thank you.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Thank you.</font>

450
00:37:45,640 --> 00:37:48,000
<font color="#ffff00">God be with you!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">God be with you.</font>

451
00:37:52,840 --> 00:37:54,560
<font color="#00ffff">God be with you.</font>

452
00:38:06,480 --> 00:38:08,640
<font color="#00ff00">Time we were working in the fields.</font>

453
00:39:03,200 --> 00:39:05,760
<font color="#ffffff">Any sign of life?</font><font color="#ffff00"> No.</font>

454
00:39:05,760 --> 00:39:08,200
<font color="#ffff00">Tell the others to wait below.</font>

455
00:39:08,200 --> 00:39:12,080
<font color="#ffff00">Sven, you, with Ulf and Gunnar,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">go south.</font>

456
00:39:12,080 --> 00:39:14,120
<font color="#ffff00">Radnor will take a similar group</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to the north.</font>

457
00:39:14,120 --> 00:39:17,760
<font color="#ffffff">I understand.</font><font color="#ffff00"> And remember, Sven,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">when you rejoin the force,</font>

458
00:39:17,760 --> 00:39:19,480
<font color="#ffff00">we shall want to know</font>
