<font color="#ffff00">this is no ordinary raid.</font>

464
00:39:29,560 --> 00:39:30,960
<font color="#ffff00">You are the eyes of the King!</font>

465
00:39:30,960 --> 00:39:32,800
<font color="#00ffff">We'll need provisions ourselves.</font>

466
00:39:32,800 --> 00:39:34,760
<font color="#ffffff">The first village we find</font>
<font color="#ffffff">will provide those.</font>

467
00:39:34,760 --> 00:39:36,200
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, but be careful.</font>

468
00:39:36,200 --> 00:39:38,600
<font color="#ffff00">If your presence here</font>
<font color="#ffff00">can be kept secret,</font>

469
00:39:38,600 --> 00:39:41,320
<font color="#ffff00">Harald Hardrada will have</font>
<font color="#ffff00">surprise on his side.</font>

470
00:39:41,320 --> 00:39:43,680
<font color="#ffff00">Now, go.</font>

471
00:39:43,680 --> 00:39:45,560
<font color="#ffffff">Gunnar.</font>

472
00:39:54,800 --> 00:39:56,800
<font color="#ffff00">Send Radnor and the others up.</font>

473
00:39:56,800 --> 00:39:58,520
<font color="#ffff00">Then we can rejoin the fleet.</font>

474
00:40:15,680 --> 00:40:19,560
<font color="#ffffff">It's very beautiful here, isn't it?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">They could use a gardener.</font>

475
00:40:22,200 --> 00:40:25,240
<font color="#ffff00">Good day, my children, good day.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Good day. We're looking for...</font>

476
00:40:25,240 --> 00:40:27,880
<font color="#ffff00">Indeed, we're all searching</font>
<font color="#ffff00">for something.</font>

477
00:40:27,880 --> 00:40:30,560
<font color="#ffff00">Some, like myself,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">seek it in the peace and solitude</font>

478
00:40:30,560 --> 00:40:34,440
<font color="#ffff00">repose behind these monastery...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">We are looking for a friend of ours.</font>

479
00:40:34,440 --> 00:40:36,600
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, and you think I can help?</font>

480
00:40:36,600 --> 00:40:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">Well, he left word in the village</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that he was coming up here.</font>

481
00:40:39,400 --> 00:40:42,120
<font color="#ffff00">Would that we could all</font>
<font color="#ffff00">realise our ambitions.</font>

482
00:40:42,120 --> 00:40:43,720
<font color="#ffff00">Be they a lifelong wish</font>

483
00:40:43,720 --> 00:40:45,800
<font color="#ffff00">or a stated intention</font>
