485
00:40:48,360 --> 00:40:51,040
<font color="#ffff00">My son, no stranger has knocked</font>
<font color="#ffff00">on this door for many a day,</font>

486
00:40:51,040 --> 00:40:52,200
<font color="#ffff00">welcome though they be.</font>

487
00:40:52,200 --> 00:40:55,280
<font color="#00ffff">Are you sure you haven't</font>
<font color="#00ffff">seen anyone around the place?</font>

488
00:40:55,280 --> 00:40:58,040
<font color="#ffff00">I'm afraid not.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What about the others?</font>

489
00:40:58,040 --> 00:41:00,480
<font color="#ffff00">Others?</font><font color="#ffffff"> The other...monks.</font>

490
00:41:00,480 --> 00:41:02,480
<font color="#ffff00">Ah, the other monks, yes.</font>

491
00:41:02,480 --> 00:41:05,480
<font color="#ffff00">I'm sure they would have mentioned</font>
<font color="#ffff00">it to me had they seen him.</font>

492
00:41:07,840 --> 00:41:09,520
<font color="#ffff00">However, if you will wait here,</font>

493
00:41:09,520 --> 00:41:12,080
<font color="#ffff00">I shall go inside and inquire</font>
<font color="#ffff00">just to make sure.</font>

494
