<font color="#ffffff">If they... If they were part</font>
<font color="#ffffff">of the main fleet...</font>

663
00:56:09,320 --> 00:56:12,160
<font color="#ffffff">..two or three days, Father.</font>

664
00:56:13,440 --> 00:56:15,280
<font color="#00ffff">Thank you, thank you, my son.</font>

665
00:56:17,480 --> 00:56:21,440
<font color="#00ffff">Two or three days.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I'm on schedule. I'm on schedule.</font>

666
00:56:30,640 --> 00:56:33,120
<font color="#ffffff">He'll have to stay here for a while,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Father. He's very weak.</font>

667
00:56:33,120 --> 00:56:35,160
<font color="#00ffff">Yes, of course he's weak.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">He's lost a lot of blood.</font>

668
00:56:35,160 --> 00:56:37,240
<font color="#00ffff">I'd like to give him</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a blood transfusion, but...</font>

669
00:56:37,240 --> 00:56:39,080
<font color="#ffffff">Blood trans...?</font>

670
00:56:39,080 --> 00:56:41,520
<font color="#00ffff">My son, all we can do now for Eldred</font>

671
00:56:41,520 --> 00:56:43,920
<font color="#00ffff">is to wait and pray.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">But, Father...</font>

672
00:56:43,920 --> 00:56:46,600
<font color="#00ffff">Now, listen to what I have to say</font>
<font color="#00ffff">now, my son.</font>

673
00:56:46,600 --> 00:56:49,440
<font color="#00ffff">This is what I want to say.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Take your friend home</font>

674
00:56:49,440 --> 00:56:51,960
<font color="#00ffff">and give thanks that</font>
<font color="#00ffff">within these sacred walls...</font>

675
00:56:51,960 --> 00:56:54,520
<font color="#ffffff">He'll have to stay for a day or two,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Father. He's very weak.</font>

676
00:56:54,520 --> 00:56:56,760
<font color="#00ffff">Stay here?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh, don't worry, Father.</font>

677
00:56:56,760 --> 00:56:58,600
<font color="#ffffff">My wife, Edith, will call regularly</font>

678
00:56:58,600 --> 00:57:00,280
<font color="#ffffff">and attend to any additional work</font>

679
00:57:00,280 --> 00:57:02,280
<font color="#ffffff">and I will come, too,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">if work permits.</font>

680
00:57:02,280 --> 00:57:04,760
<font color="#00ffff">Now, look here, my son, I...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, Father?</font>

681
00:57:04,760 --> 00:57:07,040
<font color="#00ffff">No, nothing.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Nothing, nothing, nothing.</font>

682
00:57:07,040 --> 00:57:10,040
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, goodbye and thank you, Father.</font>

683
00:57:10,040 --> 00:57:12,080
<font color="#00ffff">Goodbye, my son.</font>

684
00:57:35,040 --> 00:57:36,560
<font color="#ffff00">As soon as it's light,</font>

685
00:57:36,560 --> 00:57:39,280
<font color="#ffff00">every Saxon for miles around</font>
<font color="#ffff00">will be looking for us.</font>

686
00:57:39,280 --> 00:57:42,400
<font color="#00ffff">We'll rest here a while,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">then travel south.</font>

687
00:57:42,400 --> 00:57:44,440
<font color="#ffff00">Why go south?</font>

688
00:57:44,440 --> 00:57:47,240
<font color="#00ffff">If we put enough distance between</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the Saxons and ourselves,</font>

689
00:57:47,240 --> 00:57:49,040
<font color="#00ffff">we can still complete our task.</font>

690
00:57:49,040 --> 00:57:51,160
<font color="#ffff00">Sven, we have failed!</font>

691
00:57:51,160 --> 00:57:54,400
<font color="#ffff00">Leave it to Radnor.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Let us think of our own safety.</font>

692
00:57:54,400 --> 00:57:57,840
<font color="#00ffff">We were landed here for a reason.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What good can the two of us do now?</font>

693
00:57:57,840 --> 00:58:00,640
<font color="#ffff00">If we meet up with the Saxons again,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">they will kill us easily.</font>

694
00:58:00,640 --> 00:58:02,520
<font color="#00ffff">And what would you have us do?</font>

695
00:58:02,520 --> 00:58:03,800
<font color="#ffff00">We could hide.</font>

696
00:58:08,920 --> 00:58:11,400
<font color="#00ffff">Coward!</font><font color="#ffff00"> Kill me!</font>

697
00:58:11,400 --> 00:58:14,360
<font color="#ffff00">Go on, kill me!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">If you don't, the Saxons will.</font>

698
00:58:14,360 --> 00:58:17,200
<font color="#ffff00">And you'll be dead, too,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">if you don't listen to what I say.</font>

699
00:58:18,240 --> 00:58:21,320
<font color="#ffff00">Nothing has changed.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Our army will still land.</font>

700
00:58:22,760 --> 00:58:25,120
<font color="#00ffff">Then think what will happen</font>
<font color="#00ffff">when we come before the King.</font>

701
00:58:25,120 --> 00:58:27,280
<font color="#ffff00">We can meet up with him</font>
<font color="#ffff00">once he is inland.</font>

702
00:58:27,280 --> 00:58:29,080
<font color="#ffff00">Say we were attacked and held.</font>

703
00:58:32,280 --> 00:58:34,520
<font color="#ffff00">Don't pretend that it is only me.</font>

704
00:58:34,520 --> 00:58:36,800
<font color="#ffff00">I'm saying what we both think.</font>

705
00:58:36,800 --> 00:58:38,560
<font color="#ffff00">Our army will still land,</font>

706
00:58:38,560 --> 00:58:41,000
<font color="#ffff00">even if we'd all been killed</font>
<font color="#ffff00">back in the forest.</font>

707
00:58:41,000 --> 00:58:43,120
<font color="#00ffff">I suppose you've already thought</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of a place to hide.</font>

708
00:58:43,120 --> 00:58:45,200
<font color="#ffff00">Yes. The monastery.</font>

709
00:58:45,200 --> 00:58:48,640
<font color="#00ffff">And ask for what? Sanctuary?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">They can't refuse us.</font>

710
00:58:48,640 --> 00:58:50,640
<font color="#00ffff">And even if they do,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you'd rather do battle</font>

711
00:58:50,640 --> 00:58:53,160
<font color="#00ffff">with a band of monks than with</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Saxons?</font><font color="#ffff00"> They'll hide us.</font>

712
00:58:53,160 --> 00:58:55,120
<font color="#ffff00">Once inside, we can take hostages.</font>

713
00:58:59,440 --> 00:59:02,160
<font color="#00ffff">If you thought as much of our task</font>
<font color="#00ffff">as you did of your own safety...</font>

714
00:59:02,160 --> 00:59:04,760
<font color="#ffff00">And yours, Sven. And yours.</font>

715
00:59:20,280 --> 00:59:23,840
<font color="#00ffff">Sight Vikings, ah, we're</font>
<font color="#00ffff">up-to-date, we're up-to-date.</font>

716
00:59:23,840 --> 00:59:25,680
<font color="#00ffff">Now, then, light beacon fires.</font>

717
00:59:25,680 --> 00:59:28,280
<font color="#00ffff">I can get the villagers</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to help me with that.</font>

718
00:59:28,280 --> 00:59:30,800
<font color="#00ffff">Everything's going on marvellously.</font>

719
00:59:30,800 --> 00:59:32,280
<font color="#00ffff">According to plan!</font>

720
00:59:36,560 --> 00:59:39,280
<font color="#00ffff">Now to convert</font>
<font color="#00ffff">this ridiculous thing into miles.</font>

721
00:59:41,560 --> 00:59:42,640
<font color="#00ffff">Ah.</font>

722
00:59:45,320 --> 00:59:48,240
<font color="#00ffff">Absurd measurement, miles,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">kilometres...</font>

723
00:59:48,240 --> 00:59:50,160
<font color="#00ffff">I don't know where they are.</font>

724
00:59:50,160 --> 00:59:52,240
<font color="#00ffff">There.</font>

725
00:59:53,760 --> 00:59:56,080
<font color="#ffffff">BANG AT DOOR</font>

726
00:59:56,080 --> 00:59:58,760
<font color="#00ffff">Oh. Oh, no more visitors.</font>

727
00:59:58,760 --> 01:00:01,880
<font color="#00ffff">It's getting so</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you can't call a monastery your own!</font>

728
01:00:01,880 --> 01:00:03,520
<font color="#ffffff">BANGING CONTINUES</font>

729
01:00:05,320 --> 01:00:06,680
<font color="#00ffff">Oh.</font>

730
01:00:12,320 --> 01:00:15,000
<font color="#ffffff">BANGING CONTINUES</font>
<font color="#00ffff">All right! All right! I'm coming!</font>

731
01:00:17,240 --> 01:00:18,960
<font color="#ffffff">BANGING AT DOOR</font>

732
01:00:38,880 --> 01:00:40,800
<font color="#ffffff">BANGING AT DOOR</font>

733
01:01:09,400 --> 01:01:10,640
<font color="#ffffff">Uh-uh!</font>

734
01:01:10,640 --> 01:01:14,600
<font color="#ffffff">I have a Winchester '73 right</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in the middle of your spinal cord.</font>

735
01:01:20,320 --> 01:01:21,720
<font color="#ffffff">Proceed.</font>

736
01:01:27,240 --> 01:01:28,720
<font color="#ffffff">Wait.</font>

737
01:01:28,720 --> 01:01:30,480
<font color="#00ffff">I thought I'd seen</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the last of you, Doctor.</font>

738
01:01:30,480 --> 01:01:31,880
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, did you now?</font>

739
01:01:31,880 --> 01:01:34,680
<font color="#ffffff">Well, as it happens, I happen</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to be a very curious fellow.</font>

740
01:01:34,680 --> 01:01:38,600
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, very curious. Now, then,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I have some questions for you</font>

741
01:01:38,600 --> 01:01:41,440
<font color="#ffffff">and I want them answered.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Continue, hmm?</font>

742
01:01:48,400 --> 01:01:50,000
<font color="#ffff00">It was somewhere about here.</font>

743
01:01:51,680 --> 01:01:54,720
<font color="#00ffff">I can't tell for certain, but I</font>
<font color="#00ffff">think this is an easy way down.</font>

744
01:01:55,760 --> 01:02:00,600
<font color="#ffff00">The tide. Steven, the tide's come</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes, well, it usually does.</font>

745
01:02:00,600 --> 01:02:03,800
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, but the TARDIS was down there.</font>

746
01:02:05,480 --> 01:02:08,800
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, no, the tide.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Nobody thought of that.</font>

747
01:02:08,800 --> 01:02:11,720
<font color="#00ffff">It's a bit late to think of it</font>
<font color="#00ffff">now.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yes, but what shall we do?</font>

748
01:02:11,720 --> 01:02:14,200
<font color="#00ffff">Look, if the Doctor came back here,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">he'd have moved it.</font>

749
01:02:14,200 --> 01:02:16,880
<font color="#00ffff">He wouldn't have left it</font>
<font color="#00ffff">on the beach.</font>

750
01:02:18,520 --> 01:02:21,480
<font color="#ffff00">The only way the Doctor</font>
<font color="#ffff00">could move the TARDIS</font>

751
01:02:21,480 --> 01:02:23,360
<font color="#ffff00">would be to dematerialise.</font>

752
01:02:23,360 --> 01:02:24,880
<font color="#00ffff">So?</font>

753
01:02:24,880 --> 01:02:27,760
<font color="#ffff00">If the Doctor left</font>
<font color="#ffff00">here in the TARDIS,</font>

754
01:02:27,760 --> 01:02:29,480
<font color="#ffff00">he couldn't get back.</font>

755
01:02:31,320 --> 01:02:34,320
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, it can't be that, it can't be.</font>

756
01:02:39,560 --> 01:02:42,080
<font color="#00ffff">Look, there's no point</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in us sitting here.</font>

757
01:02:42,080 --> 01:02:43,840
<font color="#00ffff">I think we should go back</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to the monastery.</font>

758
01:02:43,840 --> 01:02:45,840
<font color="#ffff00">The monastery.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What's the point of that now?</font>

759
01:02:45,840 --> 01:02:47,840
<font color="#00ffff">At least we'd be doing</font>
<font color="#00ffff">something practical.</font>

760
01:02:47,840 --> 01:02:50,160
<font color="#00ffff">Whatever's happened down there,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">has happened.</font>

761
01:02:50,160 --> 01:02:53,200
<font color="#00ffff">There's no point in moping about it.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I'm not moping!</font>

762
01:02:53,200 --> 01:02:55,400
<font color="#ffff00">You don't know what</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the TARDIS meant.</font>

763
01:03:00,720 --> 01:03:02,120
<font color="#00ffff">Come on.</font>

764
01:03:05,360 --> 01:03:06,880
<font color="#00ffff">What's this?</font>

765
01:03:10,280 --> 01:03:12,440
<font color="#00ffff">Vicki, come and take a look at this.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What?</font>

766
01:03:12,440 --> 01:03:14,480
<font color="#00ffff">Just come and look!</font>

767
01:03:18,000 --> 01:03:20,840
<font color="#00ffff">What do you make of that?</font><font color="#ffff00"> It's a...</font>

768
01:03:20,840 --> 01:03:23,440
<font color="#ffff00">It's a gun of sorts.</font>

769
01:03:23,440 --> 01:03:26,000
<font color="#00ffff">Trained out to sea,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">hidden by the bushes.</font>

770
01:03:26,000 --> 01:03:29,960
<font color="#00ffff">Look, in Saxon times, they used</font>
<font color="#00ffff">swords and bows and arrows,</font>

771
01:03:29,960 --> 01:03:31,600
<font color="#00ffff">not things like this, didn't they?</font>

772
01:03:31,600 --> 01:03:33,800
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, you're right.</font>

773
01:03:33,800 --> 01:03:35,560
<font color="#00ffff">The Monk, it must be.</font>

774
01:03:35,560 --> 01:03:38,120
<font color="#00ffff">You still say there's no point</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in going back to the monastery?</font>

775
01:03:38,120 --> 01:03:39,400
<font color="#00ffff">Come on.</font>

776
01:03:53,600 --> 01:03:56,000
<font color="#ffffff">All right. That will do.</font>

777
01:03:56,000 --> 01:03:59,520
<font color="#ffffff">You know, I believe we've come</font>
<font color="#ffffff">through this corridor twice already.</font>

778
01:03:59,520 --> 01:04:02,160
<font color="#ffffff">It's no use you playing for time,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you know. I want some answers.</font>

779
01:04:02,160 --> 01:04:05,400
<font color="#ffffff">Uh-uh. Now, I wouldn't do that</font>
<font color="#ffffff">if I were you.</font>

780
01:04:05,400 --> 01:04:06,800
<font color="#ffffff">This may not be a gun,</font>

781
01:04:06,800 --> 01:04:09,880
<font color="#ffffff">but I can still do you</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a considerable amount of harm.</font>

782
01:04:09,880 --> 01:04:12,760
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, a man of violence.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I'm surprised at you.</font>

783
01:04:12,760 --> 01:04:14,480
<font color="#ffffff">Never mind about all that.</font>

784
01:04:14,480 --> 01:04:17,000
<font color="#ffffff">What is it you're doing here?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What are you up to?</font>

785
01:04:17,000 --> 01:04:18,640
<font color="#ffffff">BANG AT DOOR</font>

786
01:04:17,000 --> 01:04:18,640
<font color="#00ffff">The door. I must go.</font>

787
01:04:18,640 --> 01:04:20,760
<font color="#ffffff">Just leave that, shall we? Hmm?</font>

788
01:04:20,760 --> 01:04:23,760
<font color="#00ffff">If I don't go, they'll get</font>
<font color="#00ffff">suspicious.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Then we'll both go.</font>

789
01:04:23,760 --> 01:04:26,640
<font color="#ffffff">I'll open the door,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">then I can keep an eye on you, hmm?</font>

790
01:04:26,640 --> 01:04:29,920
<font color="#00ffff">You open the door? No, Doctor,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that's not a very good idea.</font>

791
01:04:29,920 --> 01:04:31,920
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, isn't it? Why not?</font>

792
01:04:31,920 --> 01:04:34,360
<font color="#00ffff">Because you're not wearing</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the right sort of clothes.</font>

793
01:04:34,360 --> 01:04:37,840
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes, I see, I see.</font>

794
01:04:37,840 --> 01:04:41,400
<font color="#ffffff">First, you want to open the door,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">then you want the chance</font>

795
01:04:41,400 --> 01:04:44,880
<font color="#ffffff">to reverse the position with</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the help of whoever it is outside.</font>

796
01:04:44,880 --> 01:04:47,720
<font color="#ffffff">Secondly, you want to get me</font>
<font color="#ffffff">into a monk's habit,</font>

797
01:04:47,720 --> 01:04:50,960
<font color="#ffffff">so that whoever that is,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">would recognise me as an impostor.</font>

798
01:04:50,960 --> 01:04:54,760
<font color="#00ffff">Dear me, dear me, what an untrusting</font>
<font color="#00ffff">nature you have, my son.</font>

799
01:04:54,760 --> 01:04:57,440
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, and you can drop</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the Monk's act.</font>

800
01:04:57,440 --> 01:04:58,960
<font color="#00ffff">I'm only trying to help.</font>

801
01:04:58,960 --> 01:05:01,760
<font color="#00ffff">Whoever it is, it's probably</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a traveller knocking for shelter.</font>

802
01:05:01,760 --> 01:05:04,240
<font color="#00ffff">Who else could it be?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor, I must remind you</font>

803
01:05:04,240 --> 01:05:08,480
<font color="#00ffff">this is a monastery,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">a place of refuge, sanctuary.</font>

804
01:05:08,480 --> 01:05:12,400
<font color="#ffffff">Yes. Very well, if you have another</font>
<font color="#ffffff">cloak with the same type of cowl?</font>

805
01:05:12,400 --> 01:05:14,600
<font color="#ffffff">Proceed, hmm?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Of course.</font>

806
01:05:15,800 --> 01:05:18,200
<font color="#ffffff">And remember, no more monkery.</font>

807
01:05:19,200 --> 01:05:20,720
<font color="#ffffff">BANGING AT DOOR</font>

808
01:05:27,080 --> 01:05:29,520
<font color="#ffffff">Wait there and be quiet.</font>

809
01:05:29,520 --> 01:05:31,680
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor?</font>

810
01:05:31,680 --> 01:05:33,080
<font color="#00ffff">It suits you.</font>

811
01:05:39,760 --> 01:05:42,200
<font color="#ffffff">What is the meaning of this, sir?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What...</font>

812
01:05:42,200 --> 01:05:44,720
<font color="#ffff00">Silence, you old fool.</font><font color="#ffffff"> What...</font>

813
01:05:59,520 --> 01:06:01,600
<font color="#ffffff">This is no way to treat</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a man in my position.</font>

814
01:06:01,600 --> 01:06:03,120
<font color="#ffff00">Quiet, old man.</font>

815
01:06:03,120 --> 01:06:06,280
<font color="#00ff00">This cell will do. Lock him in here.</font>

816
01:06:06,280 --> 01:06:07,840
<font color="#ffffff">Hmm!</font>

817
01:06:09,960 --> 01:06:12,760
<font color="#00ff00">There's no key. You guard him.</font>

818
01:06:12,760 --> 01:06:15,160
<font color="#00ff00">I'll give our terms</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to the rest of the monks.</font>

819
01:06:15,160 --> 01:06:17,480
<font color="#00ff00">Hide us or he dies.</font>

820
01:06:53,680 --> 01:06:56,480
<font color="#ffff00">It all looks so</font>
<font color="#ffff00">different in daylight.</font>

821
01:06:59,960 --> 01:07:01,800
<font color="#00ffff">Aha! Here it is.</font>

822
01:07:04,560 --> 01:07:07,160
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, don't tell me we have to</font>
<font color="#ffff00">crawl down that thing again.</font>

823
01:07:07,160 --> 01:07:10,360
<font color="#00ffff">Well, we can hardly go and knock on</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the front door now, can we?</font>

824
01:07:10,360 --> 01:07:11,800
<font color="#ffff00">I suppose not.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Come on.</font>

825
01:07:17,360 --> 01:07:20,120
<font color="#ffff00">Ulf? Ulf?</font>

826
01:07:44,480 --> 01:07:46,440
<font color="#ffffff">My dear man,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you had me quite worried.</font>

827
01:07:46,440 --> 01:07:48,200
<font color="#ffffff">I thought you were never coming in.</font>

828
01:08:13,760 --> 01:08:16,240
<font color="#00ffff">Wulnoth? Wulnoth, are you there?</font>

829
01:08:18,440 --> 01:08:19,920
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, it's you, Father.</font>

830
01:08:19,920 --> 01:08:21,600
<font color="#00ffff">I'm sorry to call so early,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">my child,</font>

831
01:08:21,600 --> 01:08:24,120
<font color="#00ffff">but I must speak to your husband.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Yes.</font>

832
01:08:24,120 --> 01:08:27,560
<font color="#ffff00">Is anything wrong with Eldred?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">No, no. No, Eldred is splendid.</font>

833
01:08:27,560 --> 01:08:30,440
<font color="#00ffff">No, Wulnoth, I've come here</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to ask for your help</font>

834
01:08:30,440 --> 01:08:33,760
<font color="#00ffff">and that of the men of the village.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, we'll help if we can, Father.</font>

835
01:08:33,760 --> 01:08:36,440
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, you can, Wulnoth,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you most certainly can.</font>

836
01:08:36,440 --> 01:08:38,280
<font color="#00ffff">I'd have come here a bit later,</font>

837
01:08:38,280 --> 01:08:41,120
<font color="#00ffff">but it seems I'm going to be</font>
<font color="#00ffff">rather busy up at the monastery.</font>

838
01:08:41,120 --> 01:08:42,920
<font color="#ffff00">What is it you want us to do?</font>

839
01:08:42,920 --> 01:08:45,720
<font color="#00ffff">Prepare beacon fires</font>
<font color="#00ffff">on the cliff tops.</font>

840
01:08:47,400 --> 01:08:49,160
<font color="#ffff00">Beacon fires?</font>

841
01:08:49,160 --> 01:08:51,240
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, don't worry, don't worry,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Wulnoth.</font>

842
01:08:51,240 --> 01:08:53,120
<font color="#00ffff">I'm expecting</font>
<font color="#00ffff">some building materials</font>

843
01:08:53,120 --> 01:08:54,840
<font color="#00ffff">for reconstructing the monastery.</font>

844
01:08:54,840 --> 01:08:56,200
<font color="#00ffff">They're coming by sea</font>

845
01:08:56,200 --> 01:08:59,000
<font color="#00ffff">and I promised I'd give</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the ship our exact location.</font>

846
01:08:59,000 --> 01:09:01,080
<font color="#ffff00">Well, when are you</font>
<font color="#ffff00">expecting the ship?</font>

847
01:09:01,080 --> 01:09:03,600
<font color="#ffff00">It'll take a little while</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to prepare a beacon.</font>

848
01:09:03,600 --> 01:09:06,440
<font color="#00ffff">In a day or two, maybe three.</font>

849
01:09:06,440 --> 01:09:09,640
<font color="#00ffff">Now, Wulnoth, you will light</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the fires when I ask, won't you,</font>

850
01:09:09,640 --> 01:09:11,000
<font color="#00ffff">and keep them burning?</font>

851
01:09:15,880 --> 01:09:17,480
<font color="#ffff00">If you say so, Father.</font>

852
01:09:17,480 --> 01:09:19,520
<font color="#00ffff">Splendid. Splendid.</font>

853
01:09:19,520 --> 01:09:21,720
<font color="#00ffff">Now I must go back to the monastery.</font>

854
01:09:21,720 --> 01:09:25,200
<font color="#00ffff">Eldred needs rather special care.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Good day, my children.</font>

855
01:09:25,200 --> 01:09:27,160
<font color="#ffff00">Good day, Father.</font><font color="#00ff00"> Good day, Father.</font>

856
01:09:31,760 --> 01:09:34,640
<font color="#ffff00">What did the old man say</font>
<font color="#ffff00">of the Vikings?</font>

857
01:09:34,640 --> 01:09:37,640
<font color="#00ff00">He spoke of a planned invasion</font>

858
01:09:37,640 --> 01:09:39,720
<font color="#00ff00">of many hundred ships.</font>

859
01:09:44,160 --> 01:09:47,920
<font color="#ffff00">Beacon fires on the cliff tops...</font>

860
01:09:53,440 --> 01:09:55,640
<font color="#ffff00">A Viking?</font>

861
01:09:55,640 --> 01:09:58,200
<font color="#00ffff">Well, whoever he is,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">he's lost an argument with somebody.</font>

862
01:09:58,200 --> 01:10:01,720
<font color="#00ffff">Anyway, we can't bother about it.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Let's go and have a look around.</font>

863
01:10:01,720 --> 01:10:03,320
<font color="#ffff00">What are we looking for anyway?</font>

864
01:10:03,320 --> 01:10:05,320
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, we'll know when we find it,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">won't we?</font>

865
01:10:14,480 --> 01:10:16,520
<font color="#00ffff">Oh.</font>

866
01:10:16,520 --> 01:10:19,280
<font color="#00ffff">You're still here, are you? Good.</font>

867
01:10:19,280 --> 01:10:21,480
<font color="#00ffff">All I've got to do now</font>
<font color="#00ffff">is to take care of you,</font>

868
01:10:21,480 --> 01:10:23,040
<font color="#00ffff">your friend and the Doctor.</font>

869
01:10:23,040 --> 01:10:25,200
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, by the way,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you'll be pleased to know</font>

870
01:10:25,200 --> 01:10:28,240
<font color="#00ffff">I've arranged the fires</font>
<font color="#00ffff">for your colleagues.</font>

871
01:10:30,360 --> 01:10:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">There you are, my dear fellow.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I knew you'd come back.</font>

872
01:10:33,040 --> 01:10:36,000
<font color="#ffffff">Now which fires?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What are they for? Hmm?</font>

873
01:10:40,360 --> 01:10:43,400
<font color="#00ffff">It's going to take us hours</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to search this place properly.</font>

874
01:10:47,320 --> 01:10:51,240
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, Steven. Look at this.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I think it's a cable.</font>

875
01:10:53,000 --> 01:10:54,600
<font color="#00ffff">It is.</font>

876
01:10:54,600 --> 01:10:58,160
<font color="#00ffff">Well, that's strange.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">What's it doing coming out of here?</font>

877
01:10:58,160 --> 01:11:01,000
<font color="#ffff00">A door!</font><font color="#00ffff"> Let me have a look.</font>

878
01:11:01,000 --> 01:11:02,920
<font color="#00ffff">We can get inside!</font>

879
01:11:12,600 --> 01:11:17,480
<font color="#ffff00">It's a TARDIS!</font>
<font color="#ffff00">The Monk's got a TARDIS.</font>

880
01:11:17,480 --> 01:11:22,480
<font color="#ffffff">I repeat my question. Which fires</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and what are they for, hmm?</font>

881
01:11:22,480 --> 01:11:24,120
<font color="#00ffff">All right, then.</font>

882
01:11:24,120 --> 01:11:26,680
<font color="#00ffff">They're a signal for King Hardrada</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and the Viking fleet.</font>

883
01:11:26,680 --> 01:11:28,680
<font color="#ffffff">I see.</font>

884
01:11:28,680 --> 01:11:33,240
<font color="#00ffff">They'll think it's a landing place.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">They'll come in unsuspecting!</font>

885
01:11:33,240 --> 01:11:36,600
<font color="#00ffff">And then...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Well? Out with it!</font>

886
01:11:36,600 --> 01:11:38,800
<font color="#00ffff">I'm going to destroy them!</font>

887
01:11:50,840 --> 01:11:53,320
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, Vicki.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Come and take a look at this.</font>

888
01:11:53,320 --> 01:11:56,320
<font color="#ffff00">He's got a sort of fantastic</font>
<font color="#ffff00">private collection.</font>

889
01:12:02,800 --> 01:12:06,320
<font color="#00ffff">He's got something from every period</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and every place.</font>

890
01:12:13,760 --> 01:12:16,280
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, come and take a look at this.</font>

891
01:12:19,000 --> 01:12:21,120
<font color="#ffff00">Looks like</font>
<font color="#ffff00">some kind of neutron bomb, I think.</font>

892
01:12:21,120 --> 01:12:23,880
<font color="#00ffff">Pretty unpleasant-looking things,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">whatever they are.</font>

893
01:12:23,880 --> 01:12:27,440
<font color="#ffff00">Hey, these could be fired by that</font>
<font color="#ffff00">weapon we saw up on the cliff top.</font>

894
01:12:27,440 --> 01:12:30,000
<font color="#ffff00">I wonder what he wants to do,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">sink a ship?</font>

895
01:12:30,000 --> 01:12:31,960
<font color="#00ffff">He could sink a whole navy</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with that lot, I should think.</font>

896
01:12:31,960 --> 01:12:33,960
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, but the point is</font>
<font color="#ffff00">why would he want to?</font>

897
01:12:33,960 --> 01:12:36,080
<font color="#00ffff">Why has he done a lot of things?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Listen to this.</font>

898
01:12:36,080 --> 01:12:39,000
<font color="#ffff00">Why? What have you got there?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">A logbook, a sort of diary.</font>

899
01:12:39,000 --> 01:12:42,160
<font color="#00ffff">Listen, "Met Leonardo da Vinci..."</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Who?</font>

900
01:12:42,160 --> 01:12:44,000
<font color="#00ffff">Da Vinci! Listen!</font>

901
01:12:44,000 --> 01:12:46,600
<font color="#00ffff">"Met Leonardo da Vinci</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and discussed with him</font>

902
01:12:46,600 --> 01:12:49,520
<font color="#00ffff">"the principles of powered flight."</font>
<font color="#ffff00">What?!</font>

903
01:12:52,400 --> 01:12:54,600
<font color="#ffff00">Da Vinci lived in the Middle Ages.</font>

904
01:12:54,600 --> 01:12:58,360
<font color="#ffff00">I know he tried to build a flying</font>
<font color="#ffff00">machine, a sort of aeroplane.</font>

905
01:12:58,360 --> 01:13:01,720
<font color="#00ffff">I know! And according to this, it</font>
<font color="#00ffff">was the Monk who put him up to it.</font>

906
01:13:01,720 --> 01:13:03,560
<font color="#00ffff">And listen to this.</font>

907
01:13:03,560 --> 01:13:07,800
<font color="#00ffff">"Put £200 in a London bank in 1968.</font>

908
01:13:07,800 --> 01:13:10,040
<font color="#00ffff">"Nipped forward 200 years</font>

909
01:13:10,040 --> 01:13:13,200
<font color="#00ffff">"and collected a fortune</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in compound interest."</font>

910
01:13:13,200 --> 01:13:15,760
<font color="#ffffff">So that's it!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">You're a time meddler!</font>

911
01:13:15,760 --> 01:13:17,960
<font color="#ffffff">No wonder you wanted</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to get rid of me.</font>

912
01:13:17,960 --> 01:13:21,200
<font color="#ffffff">And what are you trying</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to get up to this time, hmm?</font>

913
01:13:21,200 --> 01:13:24,600
<font color="#00ffff">I'm sure you'll approve, Doctor.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Are you quite mad?</font>

914
01:13:24,600 --> 01:13:26,240
<font color="#ffffff">You know as well as I do</font>

915
01:13:26,240 --> 01:13:28,840
<font color="#ffffff">the golden rule about space</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and time travelling.</font>

916
01:13:28,840 --> 01:13:31,920
<font color="#ffffff">"Never, never interfere</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with the course of history."</font>

917
01:13:31,920 --> 01:13:36,560
<font color="#00ffff">And who says so?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor, it's more fun my way.</font>

918
01:13:36,560 --> 01:13:38,520
<font color="#00ffff">I can make things happen</font>
<font color="#00ffff">ahead of their time!</font>

919
01:13:38,520 --> 01:13:40,440
<font color="#ffffff">Is that so?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yes, indeed.</font>

920
01:13:40,440 --> 01:13:41,600
<font color="#00ffff">For instance,</font>

921
01:13:41,600 --> 01:13:44,800
<font color="#00ffff">do you really believe the ancient</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Britons could have built Stonehenge</font>

922
01:13:44,800 --> 01:13:48,080
<font color="#00ffff">without the aid</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of my anti-gravitational lift?</font>

923
01:13:48,080 --> 01:13:50,960
<font color="#ffffff">And what mischief are you up to now,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">hmm?</font>

924
01:13:50,960 --> 01:13:52,960
<font color="#00ffff">Mischief? No, no. A master plan.</font>

925
01:13:52,960 --> 01:13:55,320
<font color="#00ffff">A master plan to end</font>
<font color="#00ffff">all master plans!</font>

926
01:13:55,320 --> 01:13:56,560
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, is that so?</font>

927
01:13:56,560 --> 01:13:59,400
<font color="#00ffff">The whole course of history changed</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in one single swoop.</font>

928
01:13:59,400 --> 01:14:01,800
<font color="#ffffff">By wiping out the Viking fleet?</font>

929
01:14:01,800 --> 01:14:04,920
<font color="#00ffff">Exactly, Doctor, exactly!</font>

930
01:14:04,920 --> 01:14:07,680
<font color="#00ffff">Of course, obviously,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I don't have to remind you</font>

931
01:14:07,680 --> 01:14:10,840
<font color="#00ffff">that the main reason William the</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Conqueror won the Battle of Hastings</font>

932
01:14:10,840 --> 01:14:12,760
<font color="#00ffff">was because King Harold</font>
<font color="#00ffff">had to march</font>

933
01:14:12,760 --> 01:14:15,200
<font color="#00ffff">to Stamford Bridge</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and defeat the Vikings first.</font>

934
01:14:15,200 --> 01:14:17,040
<font color="#ffffff">So you plan to save him the journey?</font>

935
01:14:17,040 --> 01:14:20,120
<font color="#00ffff">That's right, precisely!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">A fresh army, no desertions.</font>

936
01:14:20,120 --> 01:14:23,880
<font color="#00ffff">King Harold will kick William back</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to Normandy before he knows what</font>
<font color="#00ffff">happened.</font>

937
01:14:23,880 --> 01:14:27,760
<font color="#00ffff">It's quite a plan, eh?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes. It's quite a plan.</font>

938
01:14:27,760 --> 01:14:29,520
<font color="#ffffff">It's quite a plan, yes.</font>

939
01:14:29,520 --> 01:14:33,040
<font color="#ffffff">I count myself</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a very fortunate person indeed</font>

940
01:14:33,040 --> 01:14:35,800
<font color="#ffffff">to be here in time</font>

941
01:14:35,800 --> 01:14:38,520
<font color="#ffffff">to prevent</font>
<font color="#ffffff">this disgusting exhibition!</font>

942
01:14:38,520 --> 01:14:40,400
<font color="#00ffff">You haven't prevented it yet,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor.</font>

943
01:14:40,400 --> 01:14:42,120
<font color="#ffffff">Haven't I? Where is this machine?</font>

944
01:14:42,120 --> 01:14:44,960
<font color="#00ffff">I don't allow anybody in there.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Where is it, hmm?</font>

945
01:14:45,960 --> 01:14:48,040
<font color="#00ffff">This way, Doctor.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Hmm!</font>

946
01:14:51,920 --> 01:14:53,280
<font color="#ffffff">Ulf?</font>

947
01:14:53,280 --> 01:14:55,760
<font color="#ffffff">Ulf, where are you? Ulf?</font>

948
01:14:59,120 --> 01:15:00,960
<font color="#ffff00">Viking!</font>

949
01:15:14,320 --> 01:15:15,840
<font color="#00ffff">Where have you been?</font>

950
01:15:15,840 --> 01:15:19,000
<font color="#ffffff">The Monk tricked me into a cell</font>
<font color="#ffffff">then knocked me out.</font>

951
01:15:19,000 --> 01:15:20,920
<font color="#00ffff">Can't you even guard one old man?</font>

952
01:15:20,920 --> 01:15:23,560
<font color="#ffffff">You haven't done</font>
<font color="#ffffff">much better yourself.</font>

953
01:15:23,560 --> 01:15:26,120
<font color="#ffffff">Come on.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We should get back to the forest.</font>

954
01:15:26,120 --> 01:15:28,000
<font color="#00ffff">No, we'll stay here.</font>

955
01:15:28,000 --> 01:15:30,560
<font color="#ffffff">Here?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Safer than being outside,</font>

956
01:15:30,560 --> 01:15:33,080
<font color="#00ffff">unless you prefer</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to meet the Saxons again.</font>

957
01:15:33,080 --> 01:15:35,120
<font color="#ffffff">They wouldn't take us so easily</font>
<font color="#ffffff">this time.</font>

958
01:15:35,120 --> 01:15:36,960
<font color="#ffffff">Nor would we be hampered</font>
<font color="#ffffff">by the mead.</font>

959
01:15:36,960 --> 01:15:39,440
<font color="#00ffff">Maybe not.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">But I'll choose the monks</font>

960
01:15:39,440 --> 01:15:42,720
<font color="#00ffff">and whatever treasure may be stored</font>
<font color="#00ffff">inside these walls.</font>

961
01:15:42,720 --> 01:15:44,680
<font color="#ffffff">Treasure...</font>

962
01:15:48,000 --> 01:15:50,200
<font color="#00ffff">Oh.</font>

963
01:15:50,200 --> 01:15:53,640
<font color="#00ffff">Well, here we are.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">That's my time ship.</font>

964
01:15:53,640 --> 01:15:57,000
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, so that's it, eh?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">This horrible block of stone.</font>

965
01:15:57,000 --> 01:15:59,520
<font color="#00ffff">This horrible block of stone, as</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you call it,</font>

966
01:15:59,520 --> 01:16:01,080
<font color="#00ffff">is a perfect Saxon sarcophagus.</font>

967
01:16:01,080 --> 01:16:04,440
<font color="#ffffff">A Saxon what?</font><font color="#00ffff"> Sarcophagus.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, quite so.</font>

968
01:16:04,440 --> 01:16:06,760
<font color="#00ffff">And more in keeping</font>
<font color="#00ffff">with the period,</font>

969
01:16:06,760 --> 01:16:09,280
<font color="#00ffff">I would say,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">than a modern police box.</font>

970
01:16:09,280 --> 01:16:11,560
<font color="#00ffff">What's the matter, Doctor?</font>

971
01:16:11,560 --> 01:16:13,720
<font color="#00ffff">Can't you repair</font>
<font color="#00ffff">your camouflage unit?</font>

972
01:16:13,720 --> 01:16:16,160
<font color="#ffffff">Now, now, now,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">don't try and bamboozle me.</font>

973
01:16:16,160 --> 01:16:19,880
<font color="#ffffff">It so happens that your machine</font>
<font color="#ffffff">fits into this monastery,</font>

974
01:16:19,880 --> 01:16:21,640
<font color="#ffffff">but it's sheer luck.</font>

975
01:16:21,640 --> 01:16:24,640
<font color="#00ffff">Luck? Luck?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, no, there's no luck about it.</font>

976
01:16:24,640 --> 01:16:27,880
<font color="#00ffff">I couldn't have picked a better</font>
<font color="#00ffff">place for my headquarters than this.</font>

977
01:16:27,880 --> 01:16:29,880
<font color="#00ffff">A deserted monastery</font>
<font color="#00ffff">right on the coast,</font>

978
01:16:29,880 --> 01:16:32,720
<font color="#00ffff">gullible peasants who believe</font>
<font color="#00ffff">everything I say to them.</font>

979
01:16:32,720 --> 01:16:34,560
<font color="#00ffff">No, Doctor.</font>

980
01:16:34,560 --> 01:16:38,120
<font color="#00ffff">No, I planned to materialise my ship</font>
<font color="#00ffff">on this very spot</font>

981
01:16:38,120 --> 01:16:41,040
<font color="#00ffff">disguised as a sarcophagus,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and here it is.</font>

982
01:16:41,040 --> 01:16:44,280
<font color="#ffffff">I see, and all this</font>
<font color="#ffffff">is part of your master plan, hmm?</font>

983
01:16:44,280 --> 01:16:45,480
<font color="#00ffff">Precisely.</font>

984
01:16:45,480 --> 01:16:47,520
<font color="#00ffff">There's nothing hit-or-miss</font>
<font color="#00ffff">about my machine.</font>

985
01:16:47,520 --> 01:16:49,160
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, isn't there now?</font>

986
01:16:49,160 --> 01:16:52,280
<font color="#ffffff">Well, let's have a look</font>
<font color="#ffffff">at this great wonder, hmm?</font>

987
01:16:54,360 --> 01:16:58,120
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, well, tell me,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">how does one exactly</font>

988
01:16:58,120 --> 01:17:01,080
<font color="#ffffff">get into this sarcophagus, hmm?</font>

989
01:17:01,080 --> 01:17:02,520
<font color="#ffffff">Hammer and chisel?</font>

990
01:17:04,080 --> 01:17:06,240
<font color="#00ffff">This way, Doctor.</font>

991
01:17:06,240 --> 01:17:08,400
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, mind your head.</font>

992
01:17:27,880 --> 01:17:30,280
<font color="#ffff00">"Destroy Viking fleet,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Norman landing,</font>

993
01:17:30,280 --> 01:17:33,880
<font color="#ffff00">"Battle of Hastings,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">meet King Harold"?</font>

994
01:17:33,880 --> 01:17:37,240
<font color="#ffff00">Well, it seems to tell</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the whole story.</font><font color="#00ffff"> But why, Steven?</font>

995
01:17:37,240 --> 01:17:39,640
<font color="#00ffff">Why is he planning to do it?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">What's his reason?</font>

996
01:17:39,640 --> 01:17:42,960
<font color="#ffffff">That's a very good point, my child.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Indeed, a very good point.</font>

997
01:17:42,960 --> 01:17:45,200
<font color="#ffffff">I must ask him that myself.</font>

998
01:17:45,200 --> 01:17:48,480
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor! You're safe!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Safe? Of course I am safe!</font>

999
01:17:48,480 --> 01:17:50,880
<font color="#ffff00">Boy, are we glad to see you,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor!</font>

1000
01:17:50,880 --> 01:17:53,800
<font color="#ffffff">Good gracious me.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I see you found the machine.</font>

1001
01:17:53,800 --> 01:17:55,760
<font color="#ffffff">Keep your eye on that, young man.</font>

1002
01:17:55,760 --> 01:17:57,880
<font color="#ffffff">I thought I'd told you</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to wait outside the TARDIS.</font>

1003
01:17:57,880 --> 01:18:00,440
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, we...</font><font color="#ffff00"> Yes. Well, we...</font>

1004
01:18:00,440 --> 01:18:03,880
<font color="#ffffff">You know, all this is very</font>
<font color="#ffffff">surprising. That's a Mark IV!</font>

1005
01:18:03,880 --> 01:18:05,520
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, yes, indeed.</font>

1006
01:18:05,520 --> 01:18:07,880
<font color="#00ffff">Is that later than yours, Doctor?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Hmm?</font>

1007
01:18:07,880 --> 01:18:10,760
<font color="#00ffff">Oh! I forgot all about it.</font>

1008
01:18:10,760 --> 01:18:14,760
<font color="#ffffff">Oh? Forgot? Forgot what, child? Hmm?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor...</font>

1009
01:18:14,760 --> 01:18:16,240
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor...</font><font color="#ffffff"> Hmm?</font>

1010
01:18:16,240 --> 01:18:19,720
<font color="#00ffff">..we haven't got a time machine</font>
<font color="#00ffff">any more.</font>

1011
01:18:19,720 --> 01:18:22,200
<font color="#ffffff">Haven't we now? Oh, I say.</font>

1012
01:18:22,200 --> 01:18:25,040
<font color="#ffffff">Well, I wonder what</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that's supposed to mean, hmm?</font>

1013
01:18:25,040 --> 01:18:27,640
<font color="#00ffff">Well, you know...</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you know we left it on the beach?</font>

1014
01:18:27,640 --> 01:18:30,600
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I remember very well, yes.</font>

1015
01:18:30,600 --> 01:18:33,120
<font color="#ffffff">It so happens that</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I was there at the time.</font>

1016
01:18:33,120 --> 01:18:36,040
<font color="#ffffff">My dear, I may appear a little</font>
<font color="#ffffff">half-witted at times, but I...</font>

1017
01:18:36,040 --> 01:18:37,880
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh!</font>

1018
01:18:37,880 --> 01:18:41,200
<font color="#00ffff">The tide came in.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Oh! Is that all, my child?</font>

1019
01:18:41,200 --> 01:18:45,000
<font color="#ffff00">Well, isn't that enough?!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">The water cannot affect the TARDIS.</font>

1020
01:18:45,000 --> 01:18:48,880
<font color="#ffffff">It won't wash away. It'll still be</font>
<font color="#ffffff">there when the tide goes down.</font>

1021
01:18:48,880 --> 01:18:51,040
<font color="#ffffff">Now stop fretting, my dear.</font>

1022
01:18:51,040 --> 01:18:54,080
<font color="#ffffff">Well, I must confess,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I do congratulate you.</font>

1023
01:18:54,080 --> 01:18:57,360
<font color="#ffffff">It's a splendid machine, although I</font>
<font color="#ffffff">do note there's been a few changes.</font>

1024
01:18:57,360 --> 01:18:59,400
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, yes, indeed, Doctor.</font>

1025
01:18:59,400 --> 01:19:02,400
<font color="#00ff00">In fact, this one is fitted</font>
<font color="#00ff00">with the automatic drift control.</font>

1026
01:19:02,400 --> 01:19:04,000
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, I see. Yes, of course,</font>

1027
01:19:04,000 --> 01:19:07,840
<font color="#ffffff">and thereby you can suspend yourself</font>
<font color="#ffffff">in space with absolute safety.</font>

1028
01:19:07,840 --> 01:19:09,880
<font color="#00ff00">Precisely, Doctor.</font>

1029
01:19:09,880 --> 01:19:14,400
<font color="#00ff00">By the way, I tried to get into your</font>
<font color="#00ff00">police box, but the door was locked.</font>

1030
01:19:14,400 --> 01:19:18,200
<font color="#00ff00">What type's yours, Doctor?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Mind your own business.</font>

1031
01:19:18,200 --> 01:19:20,720
<font color="#ffff00">Look, I take it you both</font>
<font color="#ffff00">come from the same place, Doctor.</font>

1032
01:19:20,720 --> 01:19:22,840
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, I regret that we do,</font>

1033
01:19:22,840 --> 01:19:26,040
<font color="#ffffff">but I would say</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that I am 50 years earlier.</font>

1034
01:19:26,040 --> 01:19:28,200
<font color="#ffffff">Now, when are you going</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to answer my questions, hmm?</font>

1035
01:19:28,200 --> 01:19:29,560
<font color="#00ff00">Which questions?</font>

1036
01:19:29,560 --> 01:19:32,280
<font color="#ffffff">The reason for</font>
<font color="#ffffff">this deliberate destruction.</font>

1037
01:19:32,280 --> 01:19:36,000
<font color="#00ff00">I... I want to improve things.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Improve things?</font>

1038
01:19:36,000 --> 01:19:40,600
<font color="#ffffff">Huh! Improve things, yes,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">that's good!</font>

1039
01:19:40,600 --> 01:19:42,920
<font color="#ffffff">Very good.</font>

1040
01:19:42,920 --> 01:19:47,680
<font color="#ffffff">Improve what, for instance?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Well, for instance,</font>

1041
01:19:47,680 --> 01:19:51,400
<font color="#00ff00">Harold, King Harold,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I know he'd be a good king.</font>

1042
01:19:51,400 --> 01:19:53,480
<font color="#00ff00">There wouldn't be</font>
<font color="#00ff00">all those wars in Europe.</font>

1043
01:19:53,480 --> 01:19:56,520
<font color="#00ff00">Those claims over France</font>
<font color="#00ff00">went on for years and years.</font>

1044
01:19:56,520 --> 01:19:59,880
<font color="#00ff00">With peace, the people'd be able</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to better themselves.</font>

1045
01:19:59,880 --> 01:20:02,320
<font color="#00ff00">With a few hints and tips from me,</font>

1046
01:20:02,320 --> 01:20:05,480
<font color="#00ff00">they'd be able</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to have jet airliners by 1320.</font>

1047
01:20:05,480 --> 01:20:07,880
<font color="#00ff00">Shakespeare'd be able to put</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Hamlet on television.</font>

1048
01:20:07,880 --> 01:20:11,200
<font color="#ffffff">He'd do what?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">The play Hamlet on television.</font>

1049
01:20:11,200 --> 01:20:13,600
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes, quite so. Yes, of course,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I do know the medium.</font>

1050
01:20:13,600 --> 01:20:16,040
<font color="#00ff00">Yeah.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Were you going to kill</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the Vikings?</font>

1051
01:20:16,040 --> 01:20:19,720
<font color="#00ff00">Yes. Yes, I was. You see,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">if I didn't, then King Harold...</font>

1052
01:20:19,720 --> 01:20:21,600
<font color="#ffffff">What are we going to do</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with this fellow, hmm?</font>

1053
01:20:21,600 --> 01:20:24,400
<font color="#ffffff">What can we do with this man?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">He's utterly irresponsible.</font>

1054
01:20:24,400 --> 01:20:25,760
<font color="#ffffff">Hmm!</font>

1055
01:20:25,760 --> 01:20:29,760
<font color="#ffffff">He wants to destroy</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the whole pattern of world history.</font>

1056
01:20:29,760 --> 01:20:31,080
<font color="#ffffff">Hmm!</font>

1057
01:20:31,080 --> 01:20:33,040
<font color="#00ffff">Steven! Doctor!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Hmm?</font>

1058
01:20:33,040 --> 01:20:35,280
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, quick, quick!</font>

1059
01:20:37,480 --> 01:20:39,240
<font color="#ffffff">Ah-ha!</font>

1060
01:20:39,240 --> 01:20:41,000
<font color="#00ff00">Long live King Hardrada!</font>

1061
01:20:41,000 --> 01:20:43,720
<font color="#00ff00">Those are your enemies. There!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Quick!</font>

1062
01:20:46,200 --> 01:20:48,560
<font color="#ffffff">The old man who journeyed here spoke</font>

1063
01:20:48,560 --> 01:20:51,240
<font color="#ffffff">of a Viking invasion</font>
<font color="#ffffff">descending on us.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Viking invasion?</font>

1064
01:20:51,240 --> 01:20:54,760
<font color="#ffffff">And the Monk asked us to light</font>
<font color="#ffffff">beacon fires on the cliff tops.</font>

1065
01:20:56,120 --> 01:21:00,840
<font color="#00ffff">The old man spoke the truth!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">He had no reason to lie.</font>

1066
01:21:00,840 --> 01:21:07,040
<font color="#ffffff">Fires on the cliff tops would guide</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the ships in to land. Viking ships!</font>

1067
01:21:07,040 --> 01:21:10,360
<font color="#00ffff">We know and respect the monastery</font>
<font color="#00ffff">as a place of worship.</font>

1068
01:21:10,360 --> 01:21:14,240
<font color="#00ffff">But what of a Viking spy</font>
<font color="#00ffff">who passes himself off as a monk?!</font>

1069
01:21:16,320 --> 01:21:18,440
<font color="#00ffff">Look!</font>

1070
01:21:18,440 --> 01:21:21,080
<font color="#ffffff">Eldred.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Eldred.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh...</font>

1071
01:21:21,080 --> 01:21:23,720
<font color="#ffff00">The monastery...</font>
<font color="#ffffff">What of it? What have you seen?</font>

1072
01:21:23,720 --> 01:21:25,440
<font color="#ffff00">Vikings!</font><font color="#ffffff"> Vikings?!</font>

1073
01:21:25,440 --> 01:21:29,800
<font color="#ffff00">There are Vikings hiding there.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Is that enough?</font>

1074
01:21:29,800 --> 01:21:32,080
<font color="#00ffff">Do you need more proof?</font><font color="#ffffff"> No, no.</font>

1075
01:21:32,080 --> 01:21:36,120
<font color="#ffffff">Arm yourselves!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We know how to treat the raiders!</font>

1076
01:21:44,680 --> 01:21:47,600
<font color="#00ff00">Come along, come along. If we want</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to send signals to your ships,</font>

1077
01:21:47,600 --> 01:21:50,360
<font color="#00ff00">we mustn't delay like this,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">you know.</font><font color="#ffffff"> What are these things?</font>

1078
01:21:50,360 --> 01:21:53,360
<font color="#00ff00">They are... They're charms, my son,</font>

1079
01:21:53,360 --> 01:21:56,680
<font color="#00ff00">to guide your ships to</font>
<font color="#00ff00">sheltered waters.</font>

1080
01:21:56,680 --> 01:21:58,240
<font color="#00ff00">Come along.</font>

1081
01:22:03,840 --> 01:22:05,640
<font color="#00ff00">I know you don't understand,</font>

1082
01:22:05,640 --> 01:22:08,880
<font color="#00ff00">but believe me,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">your ships will know they're there.</font>

1083
01:22:20,840 --> 01:22:24,400
<font color="#ffff00">I can't find a sharp enough stone</font>
<font color="#ffff00">anywhere.</font>

1084
01:22:24,400 --> 01:22:26,400
<font color="#ffff00">Those Vikings sure know</font>
<font color="#ffff00">how to tie knots.</font>

1085
01:22:26,400 --> 01:22:29,080
<font color="#00ffff">It looks as though that Monk's going</font>
<font color="#00ffff">to get away with it after all.</font>

1086
01:22:29,080 --> 01:22:32,160
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, but he can't, can he? I mean,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I don't know much about history,</font>

1087
01:22:32,160 --> 01:22:34,960
<font color="#ffff00">but I know William the Conqueror</font>
<font color="#ffff00">did win the Battle of Hastings.</font>

1088
01:22:34,960 --> 01:22:36,800
<font color="#00ffff">Up till now he did.</font>

1089
01:22:36,800 --> 01:22:40,200
<font color="#00ffff">If the Monk changes it, I suppose</font>
<font color="#00ffff">our memories will change as well.</font>

1090
01:22:40,200 --> 01:22:41,800
<font color="#ffff00">What about the history books?</font>

1091
01:22:41,800 --> 01:22:44,000
<font color="#00ffff">That's all right.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">They're not written yet.</font>

1092
01:22:44,000 --> 01:22:47,200
<font color="#00ffff">They'll just write</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and print the new version.</font>

1093
01:22:47,200 --> 01:22:50,520
<font color="#ffff00">But that means</font>
<font color="#ffff00">that the exact minute,</font>

1094
01:22:50,520 --> 01:22:52,960
<font color="#ffff00">the exact second that he does it,</font>

1095
01:22:52,960 --> 01:22:55,800
<font color="#ffff00">every history book, every...</font>

1096
01:22:55,800 --> 01:22:58,480
<font color="#ffff00">Well, the whole future of every year</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and time on Earth</font>

1097
01:22:58,480 --> 01:23:01,280
<font color="#ffff00">will change just like that,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and nobody'll know that it has?</font>

1098
01:23:01,280 --> 01:23:04,600
<font color="#00ffff">I suppose that's what</font>
<font color="#00ffff">I'm trying to say.</font>

1099
01:23:04,600 --> 01:23:08,520
<font color="#ffff00">There's more to this</font>
<font color="#ffff00">time travelling than meets the eye.</font>

1100
01:23:10,160 --> 01:23:12,880
<font color="#ffff00">What's the matter with the Doctor?</font>
<font color="#ffff00">He's not gone to sleep, has he?</font>

1101
01:23:15,440 --> 01:23:17,920
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor, are you awake?</font>

1102
01:23:17,920 --> 01:23:20,200
<font color="#ffffff">Wide awake, my dear.</font>

1103
01:23:20,200 --> 01:23:23,040
<font color="#ffffff">As a matter of fact,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I was just turning over in my mind</font>

1104
01:23:23,040 --> 01:23:25,000
<font color="#ffffff">what we're going to do</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with this Monk fellow.</font>

1105
01:23:25,000 --> 01:23:27,800
<font color="#ffffff">He won't listen.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">He's determined to have his own way.</font>

1106
01:23:27,800 --> 01:23:30,800
<font color="#ffffff">He's got to be stopped.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">He must be stopped!</font>

1107
01:23:59,320 --> 01:24:01,480
<font color="#00ff00">Come along, come along, come on.</font>

1108
01:24:01,480 --> 01:24:03,600
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, yes, they are rather heavy,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">aren't they?</font>

1109
01:24:03,600 --> 01:24:05,840
<font color="#00ff00">But they're a sort of special charm,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">you understand.</font>

1110
01:24:05,840 --> 01:24:08,040
<font color="#ffffff">And where are we taking them?</font>
<font color="#00ff00">To the cliff top.</font>

1111
01:24:08,040 --> 01:24:11,800
<font color="#00ff00">Now come along. I won't be stopped.</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Hurry, I'll open the door for you.</font>

1112
01:24:11,800 --> 01:24:14,800
<font color="#00ff00">There. Come.</font>

1113
01:24:19,960 --> 01:24:21,680
<font color="#ffffff">Ha-ha!</font>

1114
01:24:21,680 --> 01:24:23,440
<font color="#ffffff">SHOUTING</font>

1115
01:24:46,880 --> 01:24:48,560
<font color="#ffffff">Oh!</font>

1116
01:24:48,560 --> 01:24:51,560
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, yes, thank you.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Thank you indeed.</font>

1117
01:24:51,560 --> 01:24:54,440
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, it's a good thing for us that</font>
<font color="#ffffff">you decided to make a search, hmm?</font>

1118
01:24:54,440 --> 01:24:56,200
<font color="#00ffff">Wyour help,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">we'd never have known</font>

1119
01:24:56,200 --> 01:24:57,840
<font color="#00ffff">the Monk was a Viking spy, would we?</font>

1120
01:24:57,840 --> 01:25:00,040
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, yes, the Monk.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Now, was he caught, hmm?</font>

1121
01:25:00,040 --> 01:25:02,240
<font color="#00ffff">Now, Wulnoth and the others</font>
<font color="#00ffff">will not let him escape,</font>

1122
01:25:02,240 --> 01:25:04,000
<font color="#00ffff">nor the two Vikings</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that are with him.</font>

1123
01:25:04,000 --> 01:25:06,960
<font color="#ffffff">Hmm, yes, no doubt they'll catch up</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with him and the rest of them.</font>

1124
01:25:06,960 --> 01:25:09,280
<font color="#ffffff">But that Monk, you know,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">still worries me.</font>

1125
01:25:09,280 --> 01:25:11,400
<font color="#ffffff">I think he's got some tricks</font>
<font color="#ffffff">left up his sleeve.</font>

1126
01:25:11,400 --> 01:25:14,560
<font color="#00ffff">Where are you going to now?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Oh, we</font>
<font color="#ffffff">shall continue with our travels.</font>

1127
01:25:14,560 --> 01:25:17,080
<font color="#00ffff">Well, you must come back to</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the village with us before you go,</font>

1128
01:25:17,080 --> 01:25:19,560
<font color="#00ffff">so we can bid you farewell.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, yes, certainly, certainly,</font>

1129
01:25:19,560 --> 01:25:22,760
<font color="#ffffff">but we have one or two things</font>
<font color="#ffffff">to do here at the monastery first.</font>

1130
01:25:22,760 --> 01:25:26,520
<font color="#ffffff">But we don't want to delay you.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We will follow on, hmm?</font>

1131
01:25:29,480 --> 01:25:32,840
<font color="#ffffff">What a charming woman.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Mmm, charming.</font>

1132
01:25:32,840 --> 01:25:35,040
<font color="#ffffff">Well now, you two, come along.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">We've got a lot to do.</font>

1133
01:25:35,040 --> 01:25:37,560
<font color="#ffff00">Such as what?</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Shall we go back to the TARDIS?</font>

1134
01:25:37,560 --> 01:25:39,800
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, you know we can't do that,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">my child,</font>

1135
01:25:39,800 --> 01:25:42,040
<font color="#ffffff">not until we stop this time meddler.</font>

1136
01:25:42,040 --> 01:25:44,680
<font color="#ffffff">Have either of you got</font>
<font color="#ffffff">a pencil and paper on you, hmm?</font>

1137
01:25:44,680 --> 01:25:46,360
<font color="#00ffff">No.</font><font color="#ffff00"> No, afraid not.</font>

1138
01:25:46,360 --> 01:25:49,000
<font color="#ffffff">Well, be a good fellow and go into</font>
<font color="#ffffff">the machine and try and find one.</font>

1139
01:25:49,000 --> 01:25:52,000
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, OK, Doc.</font><font color="#ffffff"> Hmm?</font><font color="#ffff00"> ..tor.</font>

1140
01:25:52,000 --> 01:25:55,920
<font color="#00ffff">Who are you going to write to?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">To the Monk, of course.</font>

1141
01:25:55,920 --> 01:25:57,440
<font color="#ffffff">Who else?</font>

1142
01:26:06,600 --> 01:26:08,960
<font color="#00ff00">Here, this way.</font>

1143
01:26:08,960 --> 01:26:12,040
<font color="#00ff00">Ah, yes. Behind that tree there,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">there's an old well.</font>

1144
01:26:12,040 --> 01:26:14,240
<font color="#00ff00">We can hide there. Quick!</font>

1145
01:26:20,960 --> 01:26:22,920
<font color="#ffffff">There's no well there!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Where's he gone?</font>

1146
01:26:24,120 --> 01:26:26,640
<font color="#ffffff">SHOUTING</font>

1147
01:26:51,760 --> 01:26:53,000
<font color="#ffffff">Ooh!</font>

1148
01:26:53,000 --> 01:26:56,120
<font color="#ffffff">Mr Taylor! Where are you</font>
<font color="#ffffff">with that string, dear boy?</font>

1149
01:26:56,120 --> 01:26:59,000
<font color="#ffff00">Here you are, Doctor. I found some.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Gracious me, come along.</font>

1150
01:26:59,000 --> 01:27:00,640
<font color="#00ffff">What's that thing under there,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Doctor?</font>

1151
01:27:00,640 --> 01:27:03,360
<font color="#ffffff">Now keep your nose out, child.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Never mind.</font>

1152
01:27:03,360 --> 01:27:05,280
<font color="#ffffff">Did you hear what I said?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Keep your nose away.</font>

1153
01:27:05,280 --> 01:27:09,480
<font color="#ffffff">Do you want to get a shock?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">This is a very dangerous business.</font>

1154
01:27:09,480 --> 01:27:11,760
<font color="#ffffff">Now keep still, all of you.</font>

1155
01:27:13,240 --> 01:27:15,040
<font color="#ffffff">Tie this in a knot.</font>

1156
01:27:19,400 --> 01:27:22,560
<font color="#ffffff">Now...the vibrations.</font>

1157
01:27:23,760 --> 01:27:26,680
<font color="#ffffff">Ticklish. Get back, get back!</font>

1158
01:27:29,920 --> 01:27:32,240
<font color="#ffffff">Now, you two, go outside.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I'll follow in a minute.</font>

1159
01:27:32,240 --> 01:27:33,920
<font color="#00ffff">But, Doctor,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">what exactly are you doing?</font>

1160
01:27:33,920 --> 01:27:37,560
<font color="#ffffff">Don't, please, ask me questions!</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Go, child! Outside!</font>

1161
01:27:37,560 --> 01:27:39,680
<font color="#ffff00">Well, what are you trying to do?</font>

1162
01:27:52,400 --> 01:27:55,200
<font color="#00ffff">Is he coming out yet?</font>

1163
01:27:55,200 --> 01:27:57,200
<font color="#ffff00">Yes, yes, here he is.</font>

1164
01:27:57,200 --> 01:28:00,840
<font color="#ffffff">Now, back. Elbow room, please.</font>

1165
01:28:00,840 --> 01:28:02,360
<font color="#ffffff">Now keep still.</font>

1166
01:28:03,360 --> 01:28:05,640
<font color="#ffffff">We're not out of the woods yet.</font>

1167
01:28:14,400 --> 01:28:15,840
<font color="#ffffff">Ah! There it is!</font>

1168
01:28:15,840 --> 01:28:19,240
<font color="#ffffff">Ha-ha! I've done it, I've done it,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">I've done it!</font>

1169
01:28:19,240 --> 01:28:24,200
<font color="#ffff00">Well, nothing's happened, Doctor.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Hasn't it? Hasn't it, my dear boy?</font>

1170
01:28:24,200 --> 01:28:27,560
<font color="#00ffff">Aren't you going to tell us?</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, sometime, my dear, sometime.</font>

1171
01:28:27,560 --> 01:28:30,800
<font color="#ffffff">Here, put that in your pocket.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Quite safe.</font>

1172
01:28:30,800 --> 01:28:33,960
<font color="#ffffff">Ah, now.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Oh, is that the letter you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">wrote to the Monk?</font><font color="#ffffff"> Yes.</font>

1173
01:28:33,960 --> 01:28:35,520
<font color="#ffffff">Do keep hands off it, young lady.</font>

1174
01:28:35,520 --> 01:28:37,600
<font color="#ffffff">I don't want you nosing</font>
<font color="#ffffff">into people's personal</font>

1175
01:28:37,600 --> 01:28:39,600
<font color="#ffffff">and private correspondence.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Gracious me!</font>

1176
01:28:39,600 --> 01:28:42,960
<font color="#ffffff">Well, I think we've finished here.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Now let's go.</font><font color="#ffff00"> Back to the TARDIS?</font>

1177
01:28:42,960 --> 01:28:46,080
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, certainly, back to the TARDIS.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, come along.</font>

1178
01:28:56,280 --> 01:28:57,480
<font color="#ffffff">HE COUGHS</font>

1179
01:29:01,120 --> 01:29:03,240
<font color="#ffffff">GULLS CRY</font>

1180
01:29:14,640 --> 01:29:17,400
<font color="#ffffff">There it is, my dear.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">There's the TARDIS.</font>

1181
01:29:17,400 --> 01:29:19,560
<font color="#ffffff">Safe and sound.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Didn't I tell you so?</font>

1182
01:29:19,560 --> 01:29:22,440
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, am I glad to see</font>
<font color="#00ffff">that old police box again!</font>

1183
01:29:22,440 --> 01:29:23,920
<font color="#ffffff">Oh, glad indeed.</font>

1184
01:29:23,920 --> 01:29:27,600
<font color="#ffffff">Well, we must start climbing down</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and get aboard as soon as we can.</font>

1185
01:29:27,600 --> 01:29:29,960
<font color="#ffffff">There's going to be an invasion</font>
<font color="#ffffff">shortly.</font>

1186
01:29:29,960 --> 01:29:31,640
<font color="#ffff00">What? You mean any minute now</font>

1187
01:29:31,640 --> 01:29:34,200
<font color="#ffff00">the Viking fleet's going</font>
<font color="#ffff00">to sail past here?</font>

1188
01:29:34,200 --> 01:29:36,560
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, my boy,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">and history will be allowed</font>

1189
01:29:36,560 --> 01:29:39,400
<font color="#ffffff">to take its natural course!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Allowed to take its natural course!</font>

1190
01:29:39,400 --> 01:29:42,920
<font color="#ffff00">You know, I'm beginning to like</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the idea of being a crewmember</font>
<font color="#ffff00">on a time machine.</font>

1191
01:29:42,920 --> 01:29:46,440
<font color="#00ffff">A crewmember? You'll be lucky!</font>
<font color="#00ffff">He's the crew,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">we're just the passengers.</font>

1192
01:29:46,440 --> 01:29:49,240
<font color="#ffffff">Yes, and both very welcome ones,</font>
<font color="#ffffff">my dear.</font>

1193
01:29:49,240 --> 01:29:52,400
<font color="#ffffff">Come along, come along.</font>
<font color="#ffffff">Come on, come on!</font>

1194
01:29:55,480 --> 01:29:59,160
<font color="#ffff00">It's a heck of a way down.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">Wish we had a pair of wings!</font>

1195
01:30:04,040 --> 01:30:06,160
<font color="#ffffff">HE COUGHS</font>

1196
01:30:07,760 --> 01:30:12,320
<font color="#00ff00">Oh. Oh, I'm getting too old for</font>
<font color="#00ff00">this sort of thing. It's ridiculous.</font>

1197
01:30:23,000 --> 01:30:26,640
<font color="#00ff00">Yes, I was right. They've gone.</font>

1198
01:30:28,120 --> 01:30:31,440
<font color="#00ff00">Well, I suppose I'd better be</font>
<font color="#00ff00">on my way again, too.</font>

1199
01:30:56,600 --> 01:30:58,040
<font color="#00ff00">The Doctor.</font>

1200
01:31:02,040 --> 01:31:03,720
<font color="#00ff00">"My dear fellow,</font>

1201
01:31:05,000 --> 01:31:08,960
<font color="#00ff00">"I'm sure you will excuse me,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">but I didn't want to say goodbye,</font>

1202
01:31:08,960 --> 01:31:13,160
<font color="#00ff00">"as you are obviously going</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to be very busy for some time."</font>

1203
01:31:13,160 --> 01:31:14,960
<font color="#00ff00">He's right there.</font>

1204
01:31:14,960 --> 01:31:19,520
<font color="#00ff00">"Just in case you still have ideas</font>
<font color="#00ff00">about your master plan,</font>

1205
01:31:19,520 --> 01:31:23,000
<font color="#00ff00">"I've taken precautions</font>
<font color="#00ff00">to stop your time meddling."</font>

1206
01:31:26,280 --> 01:31:28,360
<font color="#00ff00">How could he stop a Mark IV?</font>

1207
01:31:37,480 --> 01:31:41,000
<font color="#00ff00">"Possibly one day in the future,</font>
<font color="#00ff00">when you've learnt your lesson,</font>

1208
01:31:41,000 --> 01:31:45,160
<font color="#00ff00">"I shall return and release you."</font>
<font color="#00ff00">Release me? Ha! Me?</font>

1209
01:31:45,160 --> 01:31:48,560
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, the old fool! Oh...</font>

1210
01:31:49,560 --> 01:31:53,480
<font color="#00ff00">I wonder what he meant</font>
<font color="#00ff00">by...release me.</font>

1211
01:31:55,120 --> 01:31:57,040
<font color="#00ff00">Well, I'll be going.</font>

1212
01:32:08,480 --> 01:32:10,240
<font color="#00ff00">Ah!</font>

1213
01:32:11,920 --> 01:32:13,640
<font color="#00ff00">What's he done?</font>

1214
01:32:13,640 --> 01:32:16,960
<font color="#00ff00">Ah, he's...</font>
<font color="#00ff00">he's taken my dimensional control.</font>

1215
01:32:18,120 --> 01:32:22,520
<font color="#00ff00">He's ruined my time machine!</font>
<font color="#00ff00">I'm... I'm marooned.</font>

1216
01:32:23,640 --> 01:32:27,040
<font color="#00ff00">Marooned! In 1066.</font>

1217
01:32:31,800 --> 01:32:33,400
<font color="#00ff00">Oh, Doctor.</font>

1218
01:32:37,000 --> 01:32:38,360
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor!</font>

1219
01:32:39,600 --> 01:32:41,280
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor!</font>

1220
01:32:49,080 --> 01:32:51,400
<font color="#00ff00">Doctor...!</font>

1221
01:32:55,440 --> 01:32:59,480
<font color="#00ffff">You now, looking at the size</font>
<font color="#00ffff">of the TARDIS now,</font>

1222
01:32:59,480 --> 01:33:03,120
<font color="#00ffff">I think the Doctor must have lost</font>
<font color="#00ffff">his own dimensional control.</font>

1223
01:33:08,600 --> 01:33:10,240
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, be careful, Vicki.</font>

1224
01:33:10,240 --> 01:33:12,840
<font color="#00ffff">You know the Doc won't want you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">looking through his stuff.</font>

1225
01:33:14,440 --> 01:33:17,240
<font color="#ffff00">Well...would you look at that?</font>

1226
01:33:18,440 --> 01:33:21,040
<font color="#ffff00">This proves it's</font>
<font color="#ffff00">the Doctor's TARDIS.</font>

1227
01:33:21,040 --> 01:33:23,720
<font color="#ffff00">I bet the Monk is still</font>
<font color="#ffff00">looking for it!</font>

1228
01:33:25,600 --> 01:33:27,560
<font color="#00ffff">No, he isn't.</font>

1229
01:33:27,560 --> 01:33:29,000
<font color="#00ffff">He escaped.</font>

1230
01:33:29,000 --> 01:33:30,640
<font color="#00ffff">We ran into him again.</font>

1231
01:33:30,640 --> 01:33:33,800
<font color="#00ffff">He wasn't happy how</font>
<font color="#00ffff">the Doctor left him stranded.</font>

1232
01:33:35,120 --> 01:33:37,080
<font color="#ffff00">I'm so jealous.</font>

1233
01:33:37,080 --> 01:33:39,920
<font color="#00ffff">Jealous? Of what?</font>

1234
01:33:39,920 --> 01:33:43,680
<font color="#ffff00">You had other adventures</font>
<font color="#ffff00">with the Doctor after I left.</font>

1235
01:33:43,680 --> 01:33:46,920
<font color="#00ffff">You were in love with Troilus,</font>
<font color="#00ffff">you wanted to stay.</font>

1236
01:33:46,920 --> 01:33:51,760
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, I don't regret</font>
<font color="#ffff00">one single minute of that.</font>

1237
01:33:53,160 --> 01:33:56,640
<font color="#ffff00">But the Doctor was so...special.</font>

1238
01:33:59,040 --> 01:34:03,480
<font color="#ffff00">There's no-one else like him.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, you can say that again.</font>

1239
01:34:03,480 --> 01:34:05,360
<font color="#ffff00">He rescued me.</font>

1240
01:34:05,360 --> 01:34:08,200
<font color="#ffff00">I was an orphan,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">and he became my family.</font>

1241
01:34:09,960 --> 01:34:12,200
<font color="#ffff00">I became the granddaughter</font>
<font color="#ffff00">he'd lost.</font>

1242
01:34:13,920 --> 01:34:15,840
<font color="#00ffff">He was very fond of you.</font>

1243
01:34:15,840 --> 01:34:19,080
<font color="#00ffff">He talked of you</font>
<font color="#00ffff">for all the time I knew him.</font>

1244
01:34:20,200 --> 01:34:21,760
<font color="#ffff00">He never came back to visit me.</font>

1245
01:34:21,760 --> 01:34:25,800
<font color="#00ffff">He thought you'd found your life</font>
<font color="#00ffff">in Troy and were happy.</font>

1246
01:34:27,000 --> 01:34:30,200
<font color="#00ffff">Maybe he thought turning up</font>
<font color="#00ffff">again in a police box</font>

1247
01:34:30,200 --> 01:34:33,040
<font color="#00ffff">might complicate things for you.</font>

1248
01:34:33,040 --> 01:34:36,600
<font color="#00ffff">And maybe he did stop by</font>
<font color="#00ffff">and you never saw him.</font>

1249
01:34:36,600 --> 01:34:38,680
<font color="#00ffff">He's a wily old character.</font>

1250
01:34:41,000 --> 01:34:44,000
<font color="#ffff00">I bet he's watching us</font>
<font color="#ffff00">on a monitor somewhere.</font>

1251
01:34:45,440 --> 01:34:48,200
<font color="#ffff00">Doctor? Doctor?</font>

1252
01:34:49,720 --> 01:34:52,840
<font color="#ffff00">Come out, come out,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">wherever you are!</font>

1253
01:34:52,840 --> 01:34:56,160
<font color="#00ffff">The Doctor has got to be here</font>
<font color="#00ffff">somewhere.</font>

1254
01:34:57,320 --> 01:35:00,640
<font color="#00ffff">He's as much a part of the TARDIS</font>
<font color="#00ffff">as this is.</font>

1255
01:35:00,640 --> 01:35:02,800
<font color="#ffff00">He's more than that, Steven.</font>

1256
01:35:02,800 --> 01:35:05,280
<font color="#ffff00">He's part of us.</font>

1257
01:35:05,280 --> 01:35:08,680
<font color="#ffff00">From the very first moment</font>
<font color="#ffff00">we each met him, don't you feel it?</font>

1258
01:35:08,680 --> 01:35:09,840
<font color="#00ffff">I did.</font>

1259
01:35:11,400 --> 01:35:14,440
<font color="#00ffff">The day I left him,</font>

1260
01:35:14,440 --> 01:35:17,280
<font color="#00ffff">when we said goodbye,</font>

1261
01:35:17,280 --> 01:35:19,280
<font color="#00ffff">something in his eyes said...</font>

1262
01:35:20,360 --> 01:35:22,360
<font color="#00ffff">..this was never goodbye.</font>

1263
01:35:22,360 --> 01:35:26,720
<font color="#ffff00">Oh, he's got to be here.</font>
<font color="#ffff00">It's why we're here!</font>

1264
01:35:26,720 --> 01:35:29,160
<font color="#ffff00">So we can all be together again.</font>
<font color="#00ffff">You're right.</font>

1265
01:35:31,040 --> 01:35:33,600
<font color="#ffff00">ifYou know,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">maybe if I close my eyes...</font>

1266
01:35:37,000 --> 01:35:40,480
<font color="#ffff00">You know, I think of him every day,</font>
<font color="#ffff00">I always have.</font>

1267
01:35:42,120 --> 01:35:46,360
<font color="#ffff00">If I could have one wish</font>
<font color="#ffff00">in all the universe at this moment,</font>

1268
01:35:46,360 --> 01:35:48,960
<font color="#ffff00">it would be to see him again.</font><font color="#00ffff"> Yeah.</font>

1269
01:35:50,280 --> 01:35:52,400
<font color="#ffff00">Where else could a wish</font>
<font color="#ffff00">be more powerful?</font>

1270
01:35:54,800 --> 01:35:56,800
<font color="#00ffff">Than in the TARDIS!</font>

1271
01:35:56,800 --> 01:35:58,280
<font color="#00ffff">Oh, Vicki!</font>

1272
01:36:01,760 --> 01:36:03,400
<font color="#00ffff">Let's make that wish.</font>

1273
01:36:06,080 --> 01:36:08,400
<font color="#ffffff">DEEP THRUMMING</font>

1274
01:36:08,400 --> 01:36:10,960
<font color="#ffffff">METALLIC THRUMMING</font>

1275
01:36:19,480 --> 01:36:23,160
<font color="#ffffff">FIRST DOCTOR CHUCKLES</font>

